<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.0">
  <book code="1CH" style="id">1 Chronicle</book>
  <para style="h">1 Chronicle</para>
  <para style="toc1">1 Chronicle</para>
  <para style="toc2">1 Chronicle</para>
  <para style="mt">1 Chronicle</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Adama thlahte, a chhuan indawt zêlin: Setha, Enosa,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Kenana, Mahalalela, Jareda,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Enoka, Methusela, Lameka leh Nova,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Nova, chuan fapa pathum Sema te, Hama te, Jafeta te a nei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Jafeta fate: Gomera, Magoga, Madaia, Javana, Tubala, Meseka, Tirasa,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Gomera hi Askenaz-ho te, Difat-ho te, Togarma te thlahtu a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Javana hi Elisa-ho te, Tarsis-ho te, Kitim-ho te, Rode-ho te thlahtu a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Hama hi Kusa-ho te, Mizraim-ho te, Puta-ho te, Kanan-ho te thlahtu a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Hama fa Kusa hi Seba-ho te, Havil-ho te, Sabta-ho te, Raama-ho te, Sabteka-ho te thlahtu a ni. Raama hi Seba-ho leh Dedan-ho thlahtu a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Kusa hian fapa, khawvêla hnehtu ropui hmasa ber Nimroda a nei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Mizraima hi Aigupta mi Lud-ho te, Ana-ho te, Lehab-ho te, Naftu-ho te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Pathros-ho te, Kaslu-ho te thlahtu a ni. Filistia-ho leh Kaftor-ho hi Kaslau thlahte an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Kanana fapa upa ber Sidona leh Heta hi Sidon-ho leh Het-ho thlahtu an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Kanana hi Jebus-ho te, Amor-ho te, Girgas-ho te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Hiv-ho te, Arka-ho te, Sin-ho te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Arvad-ho te, Zemar-ho te, Hamat-ho te thlahtu a ni bawk.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Sema thlahte chu: Elam-ho te, Asur-ho te, Arpaksad-ho te, Lud-ho te, Aram-ho te, Uzi-ho te, Hul-ho te, Gether-ho te, Mesek-ho te hi an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Arpaksada chuan fapa Sela a nei a, Sela chuan Ebera,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Ebera chuan fa pahnih a nei a, pakhat chu a dam laia mihringte an inṭhen darh avângin a hmingah Pelega an sa a, pakhat zâwk chu Joktana a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Joktana hi hêngho thlahtu hi a ni: Almodad te, Selef te, Hazarmavet te, Jera te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Hadoram te, Uzal te, Dikla te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Ebal te, Abimael te, Seba te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Ofir te, Havil te, Jobab te.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Sema thlah chhâwng zêl Abrama thlengin hetiang hi a ni: Arpaksada, Sela,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Ebera, Pelega, Reua,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Seruga, Nahora, Tera,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Abrama, Abrahama tih hming pu ta kha.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Ani chuan fapa Isaka leh Ismaela a nei a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Ismaelan fapa sâwm leh pahnih a nei a, a upa ber chu Nebaiota a ni. A fate hi hêngho thlahtute hi an ni: Nebaiot-ho te, Kedar-ho te, Adbeel-ho te, Mibsam-ho te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Misama-ho te, Duma-ho te, Masa-ho te, Hadad-ho te, Tema-ho te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Jetur-ho te, Nafis-ho te, Kedem-ho te.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Abrahama hmei Keturi hian fapa paruk a nei: Zimrana te, Joksana te, Medana te, Midiana te, Isbaka te, Sua te. Joksana chuan fapa Seba leh Dedana a nei a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Midiana hian fapa Efa te, Efera te, Hanoka te, Abida te, Elda te a nei a, chûng chu Keturi thlahte chu an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Abrahama fa Isaka chuan fa pahnih Esauva leh Jakoba a nei a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Esauva fate chu: Elifaza te, Reuela te, Jeusa te, Jalama te, Kora te an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Elifaza hi Teman-ho te, Omar-ho te, Zefi-ho te, Gatam-ho te, Kenaz-ho te, Timna-ho te, Amalek-ho te thlahtu a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Reuela hi Nahat-ho te, Zera-ho te, Sama-ho te, Miza-ho te thlahtu a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Edom rama lo awm hmasate chu Seira fate thlah an ni. Seira fate chu: Lotana te, Sobala te, Zibeona te, Ana te, Disona te Ezera te, Disana te.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Lotana hi Hori-ho leh Homam-ho thlahtu a ni, a farnu chu Timnai a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Sobala chu Alian te, Manahat te, Ebal te, Sefi te leh Onam-ho thlahtu a ni. Zibeonan fa pahnih Aia leh Ana a nei a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Ana chuan fapa Disona a nei a, Disona chu hêngho thlahtu hi a ni: Hamran, Esban, Ithran, Keran-hote hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Ezera chu Bilhan-ho te, Zavanho te, Jaakan-ho te thlahtu a ni. Disana chu Uz-ho te leh Aran-ho te thlahtu a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Israel rama lal an awm hmain hêngte hi Edom rama lal awm tawhte chu an ni: Beora fapa Bela chu Edom ram lalah a ṭang a, a khawpui chu Dinhaba a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Bela a thih hnu chuan Bozra khaw mi Zera fapa Jobaban a ai a awh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Jobaba thih hnuah Teman-ho ram mi Husaman a ai a awh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Husama a thih chuan Bedada fapa Hadada chuan a ai a awh a, ani hi Moab rama Midian-ho hnehtu kha a ni, a khawpui chu Avit a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />Hadada a thih chuan Masreka mi Samlaa chu a aiawhin a lal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />Samlaa a thih chuan Rehobot khaw awmna, ‘luipui’ an tih aṭanga lo kal Saula chu a aiawhin a lal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" />Saula a thih chuan Akbora fapa Baal-hanan a ai a awh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" />Baal-hanana a thih chuan Hadadan a ai a awh a, a khawpui hming chu Pai a ni. A nupui chu Mehetabeli a ni a, Matreda fanu a ni, a pu chu Mezahaba a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" />Hadada chu a thi a. Edom-ho chi hrang hrang hetiang hi an awm: Timna te, Alva te, Jethet te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" />Oholibama te, Ela te, Pinon te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" />Kenaz te, Teman te, Mibzar te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" />Magdiel te, Iram te.
  </para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Jakoban fapa Reubena te, Simeona te, Levia te, Juda te, Isakara te, Zebuluna te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Dana te, Josefa te, Benjamina te, Naftalia te, Gada te, Asera te a nei a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Juda hian fapa panga a nei: Kanan hmeichhia Batsuaii lakah fa pathum Era te, Onama te, Sela te a nei a. A fapa upa ber Era hi a sual êm avângin Lalpa chuan a tihlum a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />A monu Tamari lakah fa pahnih Pereza leh Zera a nei leh bawk.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Pereza hian fapa Hezrona leh Hamula a nei a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Zera hian fapa panga: Zimria te, Ethana te, Hemana te, Kalkola te, Dara te a nei a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Zera thlah zînga mi Karmia fapa Akana chuan Pathian tâna serh hran tlat tawh a lâk avângin Israel-hoten an tuar phah a nih kha.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ethana hian fapa Azaria a nei a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Hezrona hian fa pathum Jerameela te, Rama te, Kelubaia te a nei a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Rama hian fapa Aminadaba a nei a, ani hian Juda hnam zînga mi ropui tak, fapa Nasona a nei a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Nasona hian fapa Salmona a nei a, ani chuan Boaza a nei a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Boaza fapa chu Obeda a ni, Jesaia pa chu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Jesaia hian fapa pasarih a nei: an upat dân indawtin: Eliaba, Abinadaba, Simea,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Nethanela, Radaia,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ozema, Davida.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />An farnute chu Zeruii leh Abigaili an ni. Zeruii hian fapa pathum Abisaia te, Joaba te, Asahela te a nei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Abigaili hian fapa Amasa a nei a, a pasal chu Ismaela thlah Jethera a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Hezrona fapa Kaleba chuan Azubi nupuiah a nei a, fanu Jerioti a nei a, fapa pathum Jesera te, Sobaba te, Ardona te a hrinsak a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Azubi thih hnuah Kaleba chuan Efrati nupuiah a nei a, fapa Hura an nei a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Hura chuan fapa Uria a nei a; ani chuan fapa Bezalela a nei a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Kum sawmruk a nihin Hezrona chuan Makira fanu, Gileada farnu, nupuiah a nei a, fapa Seguba a nei a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Seguba chuan Jaira a nei a, chu mi chu Gilead rama khaw sawmhnih leh pathum chunga lal a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Gesur-ho leh Aram-ho chuan chûng lai ram khaw sawmruk chu an la a, Jaira leh Kenat te khua leh an khawperte pawh an la tel a. Chûng khuaa chêngte chu Gileada pa Makira thlahte vek an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Hezrona chu a thi a, a fapa Kaleba chuan a pa nupui thihsan Efrati chu nupuiah a nei a, fapa Asura a nei a, ani hi Tekoa khaw zuan hmasatu a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Hezrona fapa upa ber Jerameela chuan fapa panga a nei; a upa ber chu Rama a ni, a dang chu Buna te, Orena te, Ozema te, Ahija te an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Rama hian fapa pathum, Maaza te, Jamina te, Ekera te a nei a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Jerameela hian nupui dang, Atari a nei a, fapa Onama a nei a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Onama hian fapa pahnih, Samaia leh Jada a nei a. Samaia pawh hian fapa pahnih, Nadaba leh Abisura a nei a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Abisura hian nupuiah Abihaili a nei a, fapa pahnih, Abana leh Molida a nei a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Abisura u Nadaba pawh hian fapa pahnih, Seleda leh Apaima a nei a, Seleda chu fa nei lovin a thi a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Apaima chuan fapa Isia a nei a, Isia chuan Sesana, Sesana chuan fapa Ahlaia a nei a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Samaia nau Jada chuan fapa pahnih, Jethera leh Jonathana a nei a. Jethera chu fa nei lovin a thi a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Jonathana chuan fapa pahnih, Peleta leh Zaza a nei a. Hêngho hi Jerameela thlahte chu an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Sesana hian fapa a nei lo, fanu chauh a nei. Chhiahhlawh, Aigupta mi Jarha a nei a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />ani hi a fanu a neihtîr a, fapa Ataia an nei a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Ataia hian fapa Nathana a nei a, ani chuan fapa Zabada a nei a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Zabada hian fapa Eflala a nei a, ani chuan fapa Obeda a nei a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Obeda chuan fapa Jehua a nei a, Jehua chuan fapa Azaria a nei a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Azaria chuan fapa Haleza a nei a, ani chuan fapa Eleasa a nei a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Eleasa chuan fapa Sismaia a nei a, ani hian fapa Saluma a nei a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Saluma hian fapa Jekamia a nei a, ani hian fapa Elisama a nei a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Jerameela u, Kaleba fapa upa ber chu Mesa a ni, Zifa pa a ni a. Zifa chuan fapa Maresa a nei a, ani chuan fapa Hebrona a nei a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Hebrona chuan fapa pali - Kora te, Tapua te, Rekema te, Sema te a nei a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Sema chu Rahama pa a ni, Rahama chuan fapa Jorkeama a nei a, Sema u Rekema chuan fapa Samaia a nei a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />ani chuan fapa Maona a nei a, Maona chuan fapa Betzura a nei a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Kaleba chuan hmei, Efaii a nei a, ani nên chuan fa pathum Harana te, Moza te, Gazeza te an nei a. Harana pawh hian fapa Gazeza bawk a nei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />Mi pakhat Jadaia chuan fapa paruk, Regema te, Jothama te, Gesana te, Peleta te, Efaa te, Saafa te a nei a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />Kaleba chuan hmei dang Maaki a nei a; fapa pahnih, Sebera leh Tirhana a neihsak a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" />Nakin deuhvah fa pahnih, Saafa leh Seva a neihsak leh a. Saafa hi Madmana khaw dintu a ni a, Seva hi Makbena leh Gibea khaw zuan hmasatu a ni. Kaleba hian fanu Aksaii a nei bawk.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" />Hêngho pawh hi Kaleba thlahte an ni: Kaleba leh a nupui Efrati fapa upa ber chu Hura a ni. Hura fapa Sobala chu Kiriat-jearim khaw dintu a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" />A fapa, an milai Salma chu Bethlehem khaw dintu a ni, a fa tlum Harefa chu Beth-gadar khaw dintu a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" />Kiriat-jearim dintu Sobala chu Haroe leh Menuhot-a awm zâtve thlahtu a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" />Kiriat-jearim-a awmho Ithra-ho te, Put-ho te, Sumat-ho te, Misra-ho te hi a thlahte an ni bawk. Zera leh Estaol khuaa awmte pawh hêng chi pêngte hi an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" />Bethlehem khaw dintu Salma chu Netofat te, Atrot-beth-Joab khuaa awmte thlahtu a ni. Manahat-a awm zâtve dâwn lai, Zor-ho thlahtu pawh a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" />Lehkha ziak mi, Jabes khuaa awm Tirat-ho te, Simeat-ho te, Sukat-ho te, Ken-ho te nên chi khat an ni. Rekab-ho nên an inneih pawlh.
  </para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />An upat dân indawtin hêng hi Davida fa, Hebrona a awm laia piangte chu an ni: Amnona, a nu chu Jezreel mi Ahinoami a ni; Daniela, a nu chu Karmel mi Abigaili a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Absaloma, a nu chu Gesur lal Talmaia fanu Maaki a ni; Adonija, a nu chu Hagiti a ni;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Sefatia, a nu chu Abitali a ni; Ithreama, a nu chu Egli a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Hebron khuaa kum sarih leh a chanve a lal chhûngin Davida chuan fapa paruk a nei hman a. Jerusalem-ah kum sawmthum leh pathum a lal a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />fa pawh tam tak a nei. Amiela fanu Bathsebi lakah fapa pali, Simea te, Sobaba te, Nathana te, Solomona te a nei a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Fapa dang pakua, hêngte hi a nei bawk: Ibhara, Elisua, Elifeleta,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Noga, Nefega, Jafia,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Elisama, Eliada, Elifeleta;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />hêng bâkah hian a hmeiho lakah fapa a nei nual bawk. Fanu Tamari pawh a nei bawk.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Lal Solomona thlah zêlte chu a chhuan indawtin hêngte hi an ni: Rehoboama, Abija, Asa, Jehosafata,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Jehorama, Ahazia, Joasa,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Amazia, Uzia, Jothama,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ahaja, Hezekia, Manasea,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Amona, Josia,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Josia hian fapa pali, Johanana te, Jehoiakima te, Zedekia te, Saluma te a nei a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Jehoiakima hian fapa pahnih Jehoiakina leh Zedekia a nei a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Babulon sala hruai lal Jehoiakina khân fapa pasarih, Sealtiela te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Malkirama te, Pedaia te, Senazara te, Jekamia te, Hosama te, Nedabia te a nei a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Pedaia hian fapa pahnih, Zerubabela leh Simeia a nei a. Zerubabela hian fapa pahnih Mesulama leh Hanania a nei a, fanu Selomithi a nei bawk.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Fapa dang panga Hasuba te, Ohela te, Berekia te, Hasadia te, Jusab-heseda te a nei bawk.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Hanania hian fapa pahnih Pelatia leh Jesaia a nei a; Jesaia hian fapa Refaia a nei a, chu mi chuan fapa Arnana a nei a; Arnana hian fapa Obadia a nei a, ani hian fapa Sekania a nei a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Sekania hian fapa pakhat Semaia a nei a, tu panga - Hatusa te, Igala te, Baria te, Nearia te, Safa te a nei a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Nearia hian fapa pathum, Elioenaia te, Hizkia te, Azrikama te a nei a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Elioenaia hian fapa pasarih, Hodavia te, Eleasiba te, Pelaia te, Akuba te, Johanana te, Delaia te, Anania te a nei a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Hêng hi Juda thlah ṭhenkhatte an ni: Pereza te, Hezrona te, Karmia te, Hura te, Sobala te.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Sobala chuan fapa Reaia a nei a, ani chuan fapa Jahata a nei a. Jahata hian fapa Ahumaia leh Lahada, Zora khuaa awmte thlahtute chu a nei a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Kaleba leh Efrati fa hmasa chu Hura a ni, Bethlehem khaw dintu chu. Hura chuan fapa pathum Etama te, Penuela te, Ezera te a nei a. Etama chuan fapa pathum Jezreela te, Isma te, Idbasa te a nei a, fanu pakhat Hazelelponi a nei bawk.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Penuela hi Gedor khaw dintu a ni a, Ezera hi Husa khaw dintu a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tekoa khaw dintu Asuran nupui pahnih - Heli leh Naari a nei a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Naari nên fapa pali - Ahuzama te, Hefera te, Temenia te, Hahastaria te an nei a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Heli nên fapa pathum - Zereta te, Izara te, Ethnana te an nei a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Haruma fapa Aharhela thlahte neitu Koza chuan fapa Anuba leh Zobeba a nei bawk.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />An chhûng zînga zahawm fâl mi pakhat Jabeza a awm a, a nuin, “Na ti taka ka hrin a ni,” tiin a hmingah Jabeza a sa a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Israel-te Pathian hnênah Jabeza chu a ṭawngṭai a, “Aw Pathian, mal min sâwm la, ram zau tak min pe teh, nâ ka tuar loh nân thil ṭha lo lakah min vêng la, min awmpui reng ang che,” a ti a. Pathian chuan a dîl angin a tihsak a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Suha unaupa Kaleba chuan fapa Mehira a nei a, Mehira chuan fapa Estona a nei a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />ani chuan fapa pathum - Bethrafa te, Pasea te, Tehina te a nei a, Tehina hi Nahas khaw dintu a ni. Hêngho thlahte hi Reka-ah an awm.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Kenaza chuan fapa pahnih - Othniela leh Seraia a nei a. Othniela pawhin fapa pahnih, Hathata leh Meonothaia a nei a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Meonothaia hian fapa Ofra a nei a, Seraia hian fapa Joaba hi a nei a, Joaba hi ‘Themthiam Ruam’ an tiha awmte thlahtu a ni. Heta awmte hi mi themthiam tak tak hlîr an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Jefunea fapa Kaleba chuan fapa pathum Irua te, Ela te, Naama te a nei a. Ela chuan fapa Kenaza a nei a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Jehalelan fapa pali - Zifa te, Zifaia te, Tiria te, Asarela te a nei a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ezra chuan fa pali - Jethera te, Mereda te, Efera te, Jalona te a nei a. Mereda hian Aigupta lal fanu Bithiai nupuiah a nei a; fanu pakhat Miriami leh fapa pahnih - Samaia leh Isba an nei. Isba hi Estemo khaw dintu a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Mereda chuan Juda hnam nupui a nei bawk a, fapa pathum - Jereda te, Hebera te, Jekuthiela te an nei a. Jereda hi Gedor khaw dintu a ni, Hebera hi Soko khaw dintu a ni; Jekuthiela hi Zano khaw dintu a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Hodia chuan Nahama farnu nupuiah a nei a; an fate chu Keila khuaa Garm-ho leh Estemoa khuaa awm Maaka-ho thlahtute an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Simona chuan fapa pali Amnona te, Rina te, Ben-hanana te, Tilona te a nei a. Isia hian fapa Zoheta leh Ben-zoheta a nei a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Juda fapa Sela thlahte chu hêngte hi an ni: Era, Leka khaw dintu; Laada, Maresa khaw dintu; a thlahte chu Beth Asbea khuaa awmte hi an ni, la dek mi an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Jokima, Kozeba khuaa awmte nên hian; Joasa leh Sarafa; anni hian Moab nula nupuiah an nei a. Bethlehem khuaah an awm ta a (an chanchin chhuina hi hmânlaia mi a ni).
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Lal mi rawih, bêl vaw mi an ni, Netaim leh Gedera khuaah an awm.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Simeonan fapa panga - Nemuela te, Jamina te, Jariba te, Zera te, Saula te a nei a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Saula hian fapa Saluma a nei a, ani chuan fapa Mibsama a nei a, Mibsama hian fapa Misma a nei a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Misma hian fapa Hamuela a nei a, ani chuan fapa Zakura a nei a, Zakura chuan fapa Simeia a nei a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Simeia chuan fapa sâwm leh paruk leh fanu paruk a nei a, a laichîn dangte erawh chuan fa an nei tam ve lo; Simeona thlahte chu Juda thlahte angin an hung ve lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Davida hun thleng kha chuan Simeona thlahte hi Beer-seba-ah te, Molada-ah te, Hazar-sual-ah te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Bilha-ah te, Ezem-ah te, Tolad-ah te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Bethuel-ah te, Horma-ah te, Ziklag-ah te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Beth-markabot-ah te, Hazar-susim-ah te, Beth-biri-ah te, Saaraim khuaah te an awm ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Etam-ah te, Ain-ah te, Rimon-ah te, Token-ah te, Asan khuaah te leh
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />an chhehvêl khuaah te, Baalat khaw chhimthlang thlengin an awm bawk. An chhûngkaw chanchin leh an awm ṭhinna ziakna bu-ah chuan an hnam hruaitute chu hêngte hi an ni:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Mesobaba te, Jamleka te, Amazia fapa Josa te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Joela te, Jehua te (Jehua hi Josibia fa a ni, chu mi pa chu Asiela fapa Seraia a ni).
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Elioenaia te, Jaakoba te, Jesohaia te, Asaia te, Adiela te, Jesimiela te, Benaia te, Ziza te.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Ziza hi Sifia fa a ni; chu mi chu Alona fa a ni. Alona hi Jedaia fa a ni, chu mi pa chu Semaia fa Simria a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Hêng chhûngkuate hi an pung chak hle a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Khawthlang lamah Gerar thlengin an inzâr darh a, chu khaw awmna ruam khawchhak lamahte an berâmte an zu tlattîr ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Ram awl zau, hnim ṭhatna hmun, ram reh muanawm tak an hmu ṭeuh a ni. Hêng laiah hian Ham-ho an awm ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Judai ram lal Hezekia hun lai khân khîngte khi Gerar-ah an kal a, chuta awmte puan in leh an bûkte chu an tihchhiatsak a. An berâm tlatna tûr hnim a ṭhat êm avângin chuta lo awmte chu an hnawt chhuak a, anmahni an awm hlen ta a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Isia fa Pelatia te, Nearia te, Refaia te leh Uziela te hovin Simeona thlahte zînga mi zanga chu khawchhak lam Edom ramah an kal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Amalek-ho la awmte chu an that a, tûn thlengin an awm ta zêl a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Jakoba fapa upa ber Reubena thlahte chu hêngte hi an ni. (Reubena hian a pa hmei a mutpui avângin fa u ber nihna lâksak a ni a, Israela fa Josefa fate hnêna pêk a ni a; chuvângin, fa tîr chhiarnaah a hming a tel ta lo va ni).
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Juda thlahte hian an unaute an khûm a, an zîng aṭangin lal a lo chhuak na a, fa tîr nihna chu Josefa chan a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Israela neih hmasak Reubena chuan fapa pali, Hanoka te, Palua te Hezrona te, Karmia te a nei a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Joela thlahte chu a chhuan indawtin hêngte hi an ni: Semaia, Goga, Simeia,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Mika, Reaia, Baala,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Beera; Beera hi Reubena thlahte zînga hotu ber a ni. Asuria Lal Tilgat-pilnesera a man a, salah a hâwn a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />an chhûngkaw chanchin ziaknaah Reubena thlah chi hrang hruaitute hming hêng chauh hi a chuang: Jeiela, Zekaria,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Bela hi Azaza fa a ni, a pu chu Sema, Joel chi a ni. Joel chite hi Aroer khuaah an awm. Hmâr lam ram Nebo leh Baal-meon thlengin an chan a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Gilead ramah hian berâm leh kêl an ngah hle a; chuvâng chuan, khawchhak lam thlalêr ram, Eufretis lui thlengin an luah a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Lal Saula hun lai khân Reuben-ho hian Hagar-ho an bei a, an that a, Gilead ram chhak lama an ram chu an neihsak ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Reuben-ho dawt Basan ramah Gada thlahte hi an awm, khawchhak lamah Saleka thlengin an inzâr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Joela thlahte hi an tam ber a, Sefama thlahten an dawt a. Janaia leh Sefata thlahte hi Basan rama chi hlâwm dang awm vete chu an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Gad hnam zîngah hêng chi sarihte pawh hi chhiar tel an ni: Mikael, Mesulam, Seba, Jorai, Jakan, Zia, Eber.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Hêngho hi Huria fapa Abihaila thlah an ni. Huria pa chu Jaroa a ni, chu mi pa chu Gileada a ni a, a pa chu Mikaela a ni. Mikaela pa chu, Jesisaia a ni, chu mi pa chu Jahdoa a ni, a pu chu Buza a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Hêng chite zînga hruaitu ber chu Abdiela fapa Ahia a ni, chu mi pa chu Gunia a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Gilead leh Basan rama khuaahte an awm a, Saron ram phûlah te an awm darh bawk.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Juda lal Jothama leh Israel lal Jeroboama te hun laiin hêng inthlahchhâwng chanchin hi an chhui chhuak a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Reuben-ho te, Gad-ho te leh khawchhak lama awm Manase hnam zâtve te chuan phaw te, khandaih te leh thal hman dân thiam sipai sîngli leh sângli leh zasarih leh sawmruk an nei a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Hagar hnam Jetur te, Nafis te, Nodab te nên an indo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Pathian an ring a, ṭanpui an dîl a, Pathianin an ṭawngṭaina chu a chhâng a, Hagar-ho chu, an thurualpuite nên an hneh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />An hmêlmate sanghâwngsei sîngnga, berâm nuaihnih leh sîngnga, sabengtung sanghnih leh mi nuaikhat an man a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Pathian hminga indo an ni a, mi tam tak an that a ni. Sala an tân hma chu chûngho ramah chuan an awm ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Khawchhak lama Manasea thlah awmte chu Basan ramah leh a hmâr lam ramah Baal-hermon-ah te, Senir-ah te, Hermon tlâng thlengin an awm a, mi an pung chak hle.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />An zînga chi hrang hrang hruaitute chu Efera te, Isia te, Eliela te, Azriela te, Jeremia te, Hodavia te, Jadiela te an ni. Sipai huai tak tak an ni a, an chite zînga hotu challang tak vek an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Mite chuan an pate Pathian chu an hawisan a; chûng rama lo awm, Pathianin a hnawh chhuahte pathian chu an be ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Chuvângin, Pathianin Asuria lal Pula, Tilgatpilnesera an tih bawk chu, an ram a rawn rûntîr a, Reuben thlah te, Gad thlah te leh khawchhak lama awm Manase thlah te chu a kawi chhuak a, Hala-ah te, Habor-ah te, Hore-ah te leh Gozan lui kamah te chuan a awm hlentîr ta a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Levia chuan fa pathum - Gersona te, Kohata te, Meraria te a nei a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Kohata hian fa pali - Amrama te, Izara te, Hebrona te, Uziela te a nei a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Amrama chuan fapa pahnih - Arona leh Mosia a nei a, fanu Miriami a nei bawk. Arona hian fa pali - Nadaba te, Abihua te, Eleazara te, Ithamara te a nei a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Eleazara thlahte chu a chhuan indawtin hêngte hi an ni: Finehasa, Abisua,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Bukia, Uzia,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Zerahia, Meraiota,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Amariah, Ahituba,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Zadoka, Ahimaaza,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Azaria, Johanana,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Azaria (Jerusalem Tempul, Solomona saka rawngbâwltu kha),
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Amaria, Ahituba,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Zadoka, Saluma,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Hilkia, Azaria,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Seraia, Jehozadaka.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Jehozadaka hi lal Nebukadnezaran salah Judai ram leh Jerusalem-a mi dangte zîngah a hruai ve a, Lalpa chuan salah a tântîr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Levia chuan fa pathum - Gersona te, Kohata te, Meraria te a nei a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Chûng chuan fapa an nei ṭheuh va. Gersona chuan Libna leh Simeia a nei a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Kohata chuan Amrama te, Izara te, Hebrona te, Uziela te a nei a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Meraria hian Mahlia leh Musia a nei a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Gersona thlahte, a chhuan indawtin hêngte hi an ni: Libnia, Jahata, Zima,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Joa, Idoa, Zera, Jeatheraia.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Kohata thlahte, a chhuan indawtin hêngte hi an ni: Aminadaba, Kora, Asira,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Elkana, Ebiasafa, Asira,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tahata, Uriela, Uzia, Saula.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Elkana chuan fapa Amasaia leh Ahimota a nei a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Ahimota thlah, a chhuan indawtin hêngte hi an ni: Elkana, Zofaia, Nahata,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Eliaba, Jerohama, Elkana.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Samuela fapa upa zâwk chu Joela a ni a, a naupang zâwk chu Abija a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Meraria thlah, a chhuan indawtin hêngte hi an ni: Mahlia, Libnia, Simeia, Uza,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Simea, Hagia, Asaia.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Jerusalem khuaa Thuthlung bâwm an lâk luh hnu chuan lal Davidan hêng mite hi Pathian biak huna zaipâwl huaihawt tûrin a ruat.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Lal Solomonan Tempul a sak hnu chuan hêng mite hi pâwla insiamin Inbiakna bûka hla sa tûrin an inkalchhâwk ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Chûng mite inthlah chhâwn dân chu hetiang hi a ni: Kohata thlahte: Zaipâwl khat hotu chu Joela fapa Hemana a ni. Hemana thlahtute chu an chhuan indawtin hêngte hi an ni: Joela, Samuela,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Elkana, Jerohama, Eliela, Toa,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Zufa, Elkana, Mahata, Amasaia,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Elkana, Joela, Azaria, Zefania,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Tahata, Asira, Ebiasafa, Kora,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Izara, Kohata, Levia, Jakoba.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Asafa chu zaipâwl dang hotu a ni. Asafa thlahtute chu an chhuan indawtin hêngte hi an ni: Berekia, Simea,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Mikaela, Baaseia, Malkija,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Ethnia, Zera, Adaia
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Ethana, Zima, Simeia,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Jahata, Gersona, Levia.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Meraria thlah Ethana chu zaipâwl dang hotu a ni. Ethana thlahtute chu an chhuan indawtin hêngte hi an ni: Kisia, Abdia, Maluka,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Hasabia, Amazia, Hilkia,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Amzia, Bania, Semera,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />Mahlia, Musia, Meraria, Levia.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />An chipui, Levia chi dangte chu, Pathian biakna hmuna tih tûr hrang hrang ti tûrin hna an ruatsak bawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" />Arona leh a thlahte hi maichâma rimtui hâl a, hâlral thilhlan hlântu an ni. Hmun Thianghlima Pathian biak hi an hova tih tûr a ni. Pathianin a mite sual a ngaihdam nân, thilhlan pawh anni hian an hlân tûr a ni. Pathian chhiahhlawh Mosia sawi ang chiah zêlin chûng chu an ti ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" />Arona thlahte chu a chhuan indawtin hêngte hi an ni: Eleazara, Finehasa, Abisua,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" />Bukia, Uzia, Zerahia,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" />Meraiota, Amaria, Ahituba,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" />Zadoka, Ahimaaza.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" />Arona thlah Kohat-ho awmna ram chu hei hi a ni: Levia chite awmna tûra an ruatsak hmasaah an awm a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" />Judai ramah chuan Hebron-ah an awmtîr a, a vêl ran tlatna pawh an chan a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="56" style="v" />He khaw huam chhûnga khawperte leh lo ramte chu Jefunea fapa Kaleba chan a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" />Arona thlahte awmna tûra an ruat chu hêng hi a ni: Hebron, inhumhimna khua a ni nghâl bawk; Libna, Jatir, Estamoa,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" />Hilen, Debir
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" />Asan, Beth-semes khaw dai, ran tlatnate nên.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v" />Benjamin-ho bialah hêng khuate leh an dai ran tlatnate hi an behtîr a: Geba, Alemet, Anathot. An chhûngkua zawng zawng awmna tûra an ruat chu khaw sâwm leh pathum a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="61" style="v" />Khawthlang lam Manasea thlahte bialah Kohata thlah mi dangte awmna tûr ṭhumvâwrin a chhûng chhûngin khaw sâwm an ruatsak a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" />Gersona thlahte, a chhûng chhûnga an awmna tûr, Isakara-ho ramah te, Aser-ho ramah te, Naftali-ho ramah te leh khawchhak lama Manasea thlahte awmna Basan ramah te khaw sâwm leh pathum an ruatsak a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="63" style="v" />Chutiang bawkin Reuben-ho te, Gad-ho te leh Zebulun-ho awmna ramah khaw sâwm leh pahnih Meraria thlahte, a chhûng chhûnga an awmna tûr an ruatsak a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="64" style="v" />Chutiang bawkin Israel mite chuan Levia chite awmna tûr khua, a dai vêl ran tlatna tûrte nên an ruatsak a
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="65" style="v" />(Juda-ho te, Simeon-ho te, Benjamin-ho te ram chhûng khua an ruatsak pawh kha ṭhum vâwra tih a ni).
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" />Kohata thlah chhûng ṭhenkhat chu Efraim-ho awmna ramah khaw ṭhenkhat leh a dai vêl ran tlatnate an awmna atân an ruatsak a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="67" style="v" />Efraim tlângrama awm inhumhimna khua Sekem te, Gezer te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="68" style="v" />Jokmeam te, Beth-horon te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="69" style="v" />Aijalon te leh Gath-rimon te hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="70" style="v" />Khawthlang lam Manase-ho ramah pawh Aner leh Bileam khuate chu a dai vêl ran tlatnate nên an chanah an ruatsak bawk.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="71" style="v" />Gersona thlahte awm nân hêng khuate hi, a dai vêl ran tlatna nên an ruat bawk: Khawchhak lam Manase-ho awmna Basan bialah Golan leh Astarot khuate hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="72" style="v" />Isakar-ho awmnaah: Kedes khua te, Daberat khua te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="73" style="v" />Ramot khua te, Anem khua te hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="74" style="v" />Aser-ho awmnaah: Masal khua te, Abdon khua te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="75" style="v" />Hukok khua te, Rehob khua te hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="76" style="v" />Naftali-ho awmnaah: Galili-a Kedes khua te, Hamon khua te, Kiriathaim khua te hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="77" style="v" />Meraria thlah dangte chu, hêng khua leh a dai vêl ran tlatnate hi an ruatsak a: Zebulun-ho awmna Rimon leh Tabor khua te.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="78" style="v" />Jordan chhak lam Jeriko zâwn Reuben-ho awmnaah: Tlâng zâwla Bezer khua te, Jahza khua te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="79" style="v" />Kedemot khua te, Mefaat khua te hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="80" style="v" />Gad-ho awmnaah: Gilead biala Mahanaim khua te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="81" style="v" />Hesbon khua te, Jazer khua te hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Isakara khân fapa pali - Tola te, Pua te, Jasuba te, Simrona te a nei a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tola hian fapa paruk, Uzia te, Refaia te, Jeriela te, Jamaia te, Ibsama te, Semuela te a nei a. Chûng chu Tola thlahte chhûngkaw hotu an ni a, mi huaisen hmingthang tak tak an ni; Davida hun laiin an thlahte chu mi sînghnih leh sânghnih leh zaruk an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Uzia hian fapa pakhat Izrahia a nei a, Izrahia leh a fa pali Mikaela te, Obadia te, Juda te, Isahia te hi chhûngkaw hotu an ni ṭheuh va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Nupui an ngah a, fate pawh an nei tam a, indo mi sîngthum leh sângruk an awm.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Isakara thlah chhûngkaw zîngah sipaia ṭang thei mi sîngriat leh sângsarih hming ziak a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Benjaminan fapa pathum - Bela te, Bekera te, Jediaela te a nei a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Bela hian fa panga - Ezbona te, Uzia te, Uziela te, Jerimota te, Iria te a nei a, thlah khat zîngah hotu an ni ṭheuh, an thlahte chu mi sînghnih leh sânghnih leh sawmthum leh pali sipaia chhawr theih an awm.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Bekera hian fapa pakua, Zemira te, Joasa te, Eliezara te, Elioenaia te, Omria te, Jeremota te, Abija te, Anathota te, Alemeta te a nei a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Thlah tin chhiarnaah sipaia ṭang tlâk mi sînghnih leh zahnih hming ziak a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Jediaelan fapa pakhat, Bilhana a nei a. Bilhana hian fapa pasarih, Jeusa te, Benjamina te, Ehuda te, Kenaana te, Zethana te, Tarsisa te, Ahisahara te a nei a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Thlah khat lu ṭheuh an ni a, huaisenah an hming a thang. An thlahte zîngah sipai ṭang tlâk mi sîngkhat leh sângsarih leh zahnih an awm.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Supim leh Hupim-ho pawh hêng chi zînga chhiar tel hi an ni. Husima chu mi dang thlah a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Naftali hian fapa pali - Jaziela te, Gunia te, Jezera te, Saluma te, a nei a (Bilhaii thlahte an ni).
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />A nupui Aram mi nên Manasean fa pahnih Asriela leh Makira a nei a. Makira hi Gileada pa a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Makira hian Hupima leh Supima tân nupui a zawnsak a. A farnu chu Maaki a ni. Makira fa pahnihna chu Zelofehada a ni, ani hian fa hmeichhia chauh a nei a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Makira nupui Maaki hian fapa pahnih - Peresa leh Seresa a nei a. Peresa hian fapa pahnih - Ulama leh Rekema a nei a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ulama hian fa pakhat Bedana a nei a. Hêngho hi Gileada thlahte chu an ni. Gileada pa chu Makira a ni a, a pu chu Manasea a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Gileada farnu Hamoleketi chuan fapa pathum - Isoda te, Abiezera te, Malaa te a nei a
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />(Semida chuan fapa pali - Ahiana te, Sekema te, Likhia te, Aniama te a nei).
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Efraima thlahte chu a chhuan indawtin hêngte hi an ni: Suthela, Bereda, Tahata, Eleada, Tahata,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Zabada, Suthela, Efraima hian fapa Ezera leh Eliada a nei bawk a; mahse, Gath khaw mite berâm an ru lai an lo that a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />An pa Efraima chuan a sûn a, a unaute chuan an rawn lênpui a, an thlamuan a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />A nupui chu a pâwl leh a, nau a pai a, fapa a hring a, an chunga buaina a thlen avângin a hmingah Beria an sa a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Efraima chuan fanu Seeri a nei bawk; Beth-horon chuanchung leh chuanhnuai khua leh Uzen-seer khuate hi a siam a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Efraima hian fapa dang Refaa a nei bawk a, chu mi thlahte chu a chhuan indawtin hêngte hi an ni: Resefa, Tela, Tahana,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Ladana, Amihuda, Elisama,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Nuna, Josua.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />An ram lâk, an awm tâkna ram chuan Bethel leh a chhehvêl khua aṭangin chhak lamah Naaran khua a thleng a, thlang lamah Gezer leh a chhehvêl khua a thleng bawk. Sekem leh Aia khua, an chhehvêl khua te nên a huam bawk.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Hêng khawpui Beth-sean te, Taanak te, Megido te, Dor te leh an chhehvêl khuate hi Manasea thlahte thuhnuaiah an awm, khîng hmunahte khian Jakoba fa Josefa thlahte chu an awm a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Hei hi Aser thlah chhuina a ni. Fapa pali - Imna te, Isva te, Isvia te Beria te a nei a; fanu Seri a nei bawk.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Beria hian fapa Hebera leh Malkiela a nei a. Malkiela hian Birzait khua hi a din a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Hebera hian fapa pathum - Jafleta te, Somera te, Hothama te a nei a, fanu Suai a nei bawk.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Jafleta hian fapa pathum - Pasaka te, Bimhala te, Asvata te a nei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />A nau Somera pawh hian fapa pathum - Roga te, Jehuba te, Arama te a nei bawk.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />An tlum ber Hothama hian fapa pali - Zofa te, Imna te, Selesa te, Amala te a nei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Zofa thlahte chu a chhuan indawtin hêngte hi an ni: Sua, Harnefera, Suala, Beria, Imra,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Bezera, Hoda, Sama, Silsa, Ithrana, Beera.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Jethera thlahte chu Jefunea te, Pispa te, Ara te an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Ula thlahte chu Ara te, Haniela te, Rizia te an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Khîng khi Asera thlahte chu an ni. A chi hrang hotute chu indonaa hmingthang, hruaitu fel tak tak an ni. Asera thlahte zîngah sipaia ṭang tlâk mi sînghnih leh sângruk an awm.
  </para>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Benjaminan fapa panga a nei a, an upat dân indawtin, hêngte hi a nei: Bela, Asbela, Ahara,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Noha, Rafa.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Bela chuan fapa hêngte hi a nei: Adara, Gera, Abihuda,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Abisua, Naamana, Ahoa,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Gera, Sefufana, Hurama.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ehuda thlahte chu Naamana te, Ahija te, Gera te hi an ni. Geba khuaa chi hrang hrang awmte hotu an ni; salah Manahat-ah an hruai a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />chutah chuan an awm ta a, Uza leh Ahihuda pa Gera hovin an chhuak a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Saharaima chuan a nupui pahnih Husimi leh Baari chu a ṭhen a; chumi hnu chuan Moab ramah a awm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Nupuiah Hodesi a nei a, fapa pasarih - Jobaba te, Zibia te, Mesa te, Malkama te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Jeuza te, Sakia te, Mirma te a nei a. A fate chu an chi hruaitute an ni hlawm.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Husimi nên khân fapa pahnih Abituba leh Elpaala an nei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Elpaala hian fapa pathum - Ebera te, Misama te, Semeda te a nei a. Semeda hian Ono leh Lod hi an chhehvêl khuate nên a din a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Beria leh Sema hi Aijalon khuaa awm tate chi hrang hrang hotute an ni, Gath khuaa awm ṭhînte chu an ûm chhuak a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Beria thlahte chu hêng hi an ni: Ahioa te, Sasaka te, Jeremota te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Zebadia te, Arada te, Edera te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Mikael te, Ispa te, Joha te.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Elpaala thlahte chu: Zebadia te, Mesulam te, Hizkia te, Hebera te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ismerai te, Izlia te, Jobaba te an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Simeia thlahte chu: Jakim te, Zikri te, Zabdi te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Elienai te, Zilethai te, Eliel te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Adaia te, Beraia te, Simrata te an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Sasaka thlahte chu: Ispan te, Eber te, Eliel te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Abdon te, Zikri te, Hanan te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Hanania te, Elam te, Anthothiza te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Ifdeia te, Penuela te an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Jerohama thlahte chu: Samseraia te, Seharia te, Athalia te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Jaaresia te, Eliza te, Zikria te an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Chûng chu hêng hnam thlahtu bulte chu an ni, an thlahte hi Jerusalem khuaah an awm.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Jeielan Gibeon khua hi a din a, a awm ta a. A nupui chu Maaki a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />A fa upa ber chu Abdona a ni, a fa dangte chu Zura te, Kisa te, Baala te, Nera te, Nadaba te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Gedora te, Ahioa te, Zekera te, Miklota te an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Miklota hi Simea pa a ni. Hêngho thlahte hi an chipuite bul, Jerusalem-ah an awm.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Nera hian fapa Kisa a nei a, Kisa hian fapa lal Saula a nei a. Saula hian fapa pali - Jonathana te, Malkisua te, Abinadaba te, Esbaala te a nei a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Mika pa Merib-baala chu Jonathana fa a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Mika hian fapa pali - Pithona te, Meleka te, Tarea te, Ahaza te a nei a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Ahaza chuan fapa Jehoada a nei a, ani chuan fapa pathum - Alemeta te, Azmaveta te, Zimria te a nei a. Zimria chuan fapa Moza a nei a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Ani chuan fapa Binea a nei a, Binea chuan fapa Rafa a nei a, ani chuan fapa Eleasa a nei a, Eleasa chuan fapa Azela a nei a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Azela hian fapa paruk: Azrikama te, Bokerua te, Ismaela te, Searia te, Obadia te, Hanana te a nei a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Azela nau Eseka chuan fapa pathum - Ulama te, Jeusa te, Elifeleta te a nei a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Ulama fate chu sipai huai tak tak an ni, thal kah an thiam êm êm. Tu leh fa za leh sawmnga a nei. Hêngho hi Benjamin hnam zînga mi vek an ni.
  </para>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Israel mi zawng zawng hming chu a chhûng chhûngin ziak vek a ni a. “Israel lalte Lehkhabu” tihah chuan ziak luh a ni. Judai rama mi zawng zawng chu an sual avânga hrem nân Babulon-ah sala hruai vek an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />An in leh lo awmna khuaa lo kîr hmasate chu Israel mi narân te, puithiam te, Levia chi te, Tempul enkawltu te an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Juda hnam te, Benjamin hnam te, Efraim hnam te leh Manase hnam te chu Jerusalem khuaah awm tûrin an kal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Juda fa, Pereza thlahte hruaitu chu Amihuda fapa Uthaia a ni, a pu chu Omria a ni. A thlahtute zîngah Imria leh Bania an tel.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Juda fa Sela thlahte hruaitu chu Asaia a ni, an chhûngkaw hotu ber a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Juda fa Zera thlahte hruaitu chu Jeuela a ni, Juda thlah Jerusalem-a awmte chu mi zaruk leh sawmkua an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Benjamin hnam hrang hrang Jerusalem-a awmte chu hêngte hi an ni: Mesulama fa Salua te chhûng: Mesulama pa hi Hodavia a ni, a pu chu Hasenua a ni;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Jehorama fapa Ibneia te chhûng; Uzia fapa, Mikria tupa Ela te chhûng; Sefatia fapa Mesulama te chhûng: Sefatia hi Reuela fa Ibnija tupa a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />He hnam hi Jerusalem-ah chhûngkaw zakua leh sawmnga leh paruk an awm. An hming sawite khi chhûngkaw hotu vek an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Hêng puithiamte hi Jerusalem-ah an awm: Jedaia te, Jehoiariba te, Jakina te, Hilkia fapa Azaria te, Ani hi Tempul hnaa hotupa ber a ni. A pute chu a chhuan indawtin:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Mesulama, Zadoka, Meraiota, Ahituba. Jerohama fapa Adaia te; ani hi a pute chu Pasura te, Malkija te an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Adiela fapa Maasaia te, a pute chu Jazera te, Mesulama te, Mesilemita te, Imera te an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Puithiam, chhûngkhat hotute chu mi sângkhat leh zasarih leh sawmruk an ni. Tempula tih tûr ti thiam vek an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Hêng Levia chite hi Jerusalem-ah an awm: Hasuba fapa Semaia: A pate chu Azrikama te, Hasabia te an ni, Meraria thlah an ni; Bakbakara te, Heresa te, Galala te.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Mika fapa Matania te: A pute chu Zikria te, Asafa te an ni. Semaia fapa Obadia te, a pute chu Galala te, Jeduthuna te an ni;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Asa fapa Berekia te: a pu chu Elkana a ni, Netofa khaw ram chhûnga awm ṭhîn an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Hêng Tempul Pulis-te hi Jerusalem-ah an awm: Saluma te, Akuba te, Talmona te, Ahimana te; Saluma hi an hotu a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Hetih hun thleng hi chuan lal kawngkhâr an tih khawchhak lamah an awmtîr ṭhîn a. Tûn hnuah erawh hi chuan Levia chite awmna kawngkhâr an vêng ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Korea fapa Saluma, Ebiasafa tupa chu Kora chite nên biakbûk kawngkhâr vêngtu an ni; an thlahte pawh Lalpa chênna bûk vêngtu an nih kha.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Eleazara fapa Finehasa chu (Lalpa chuan awmpui teh se) an hotu a ni ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Meselemia fapa Zekaria pawh Biakbûk kawngkhâr vêngtu a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Kawngkhâr vêngtuah mi zahnih leh sâwm leh pahnih an thlang chhuak a. An awmna khaw indawtin an hming an ziak a. Lal Davida leh zâwlnei Samuelan an hna hi an siamsak a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Anniho leh an thlahte hian Tempul kawngkhâr an vêng ta zêl a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Chhim lam te, hmâr lam te, chhak lam te, khawthlang lam hawi tein kawngkhâr a awm a, chûng vêngtute chuan hotu hran an nei ṭheuh a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Hêng kawngkhâr vêngtute hi an chhûngte, thingtlânga awmte pawhin an ṭanpui ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Hêng hotu pali, thuneitu berte hi Levia chi an ni. Tempula pindan hrang hrang te, a chhûnga thil dah vên him te an mawhphurhna a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tûk tin zîngah Tempul kawngka an hawng a, a vêngtu an nih nghâl bawk avângin Tempul bul hnaiah an awm ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Levia chi ṭhenkhatte chu Tempula bungbêl hman enkawltu an ni. An hman dâwnin an lo chhinchhiah vek a, an hman zawha an rawn dah kîr lehin an lo chhinchhiah leh vek ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Ṭhenkhat chu Tempul thil serh enkawltu an ni; chhangphut te, uain te, oliv hriak te, rimtui hâl tûr te, mosola te an kutah a awm.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Rimtui hâl tûr mosola chawhpawlh erawh hi chu puithiam tih tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Kora thlah Saluma fapa upa ber Matithia chu thilhlana telh tûr chhang kang hotu a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Kohata thlahte hi sabat apianga Tempula dah tûr chhang serh siamtu tûr an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Levia chi bawk, mi ṭhenkhat chu Tempula rimawi tumtu an ni. A chhûn a zânin, eng lai pawha koh theih an nih avângin an hotute chu Tempul pindan ṭhenkhatah an awm ṭhîn, hna dang an thawk lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Hêng hi anmahni chhuan zawng zawnga hotu, Levia chhûngkaw hotute an ni. Jerusalem khuaah an awm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Gibeona ho hruaitu Jeiela chu Gibeon khuaah a awm a, a nupui chu Maaki a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />A fapa upa ber chu Abdona a ni. Chu mi naute chu Zura te, Kisa te, Baala te, Nera te, Nadaba te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Gedora te, Ahioa te, Zekaria te, Miklota te an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Miklota hi Simea pa a ni a. Chûngho chu Jerusalem-ah an thlahte nên an chipui dangte awmna bulah an awm.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Nera hian fapa Kisa a nei a, chu mi chu Saula pa a ni. Saula hian fapa pali Jonathana te, Malkisua te, Abinadaba te, Esbaala te a nei a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Jonathana hian fapa Merib-baala a nei a, ani chu Mika pa a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Mika hian fapa pali - Pithona te, Meleka te, Tarea te, Ahaza te a nei a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Ahaza chuan fapa Jara a nei a, ani hian fapa pathum - Alemeta te, Asmaveta te, Zimria te a nei a. Zimria hian fapa Moza a nei a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Moza fapa chu Binea a ni. Binea hian fapa Refaia a nei a, chu mi chuan fapa, Azela pa Eleasa a nei a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Azela hian fapa paruk - Azrikama te, Bokerua te, Ismaela te, Searia te, Obadia te, Hanana te a nei.
  </para>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Filistia leh Israel-te chu Gilboa tlângah an inbei a. Israel mi tam tak chu an that a, mi dang chu Saula leh a fate nên an tlânchhia a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Filistia-ho chuan an nangchîng a, Saula fa pathum - Jonathana te, Abinadaba te, Malkisua te chu an that a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Saula bulah chuan an inbei nasa hle a, hmêlmain thalin an kâp fuh a, a hliam na viau va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tlangvâl, a râlthuam kengtu hnênah, “I khandaih phawi la, min that mai teh, Filistia serh tan lohho hian min uankhum dah ang e,” a ti a; mahse, râlthuam kengtu chuan a hlau êm a, a that thei lo. Chuvângin, Saula chuan ama khandaih chu a la a, a bawh ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tlangvâl chuan Saula thi a hmuh chuan a khandaih ken chu a bawh a, a thi ve ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Saula leh a fate pathum chu an thi a, an lalna pawh chu a tâwp ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />A sipaite chu an tlânchhia a, Saula leh a fate pawh an thi tih an hriatin Jezreel ruama awmte chuan an khua chu an tlânchhiatsan a, Filistia mite chu an lo kal a, an rawn luah ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />A tûkah Filistia-ho chu an mi thahte râlthuam hlihsak tûrin an lo kal a, Gilboa tlângah chuan Saula leh a fate ruang chu an va hmu a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Saula lu chu an la a, an râlthuam chu an hlihsak a, Filistia ram tinah, he thil lâwmawm tak hi an milemte leh an mite hrilh tûrin mi an tlântîr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Saula râlthuamte chu an pathian Tempulahte an dah a, a lu chu an pathian Dagon tempulah an târ a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Gilead rama Jabes khaw miten Filistia-hovin Saula an sawisak dân an han hriat chuan,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />an pasalṭhaho chu an thawk chhuak a, Saula leh a fate ruang chu an va hlâwm a, Jabes khuaah an rawn hâwn a, chutah chuan sasaw buk hnuaiah an phûm a, ni sarih chaw an nghei a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Lalpa laka a bawhchhiatna avângin Saula chu a thi ta a. Lalpa thu chu a awih lo va,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Lalpa râwn lovin mitthi thlûk thiam a râwn; chuvângin, Lalpa chuan a tihlum ta a, a ram chu Jesaia fapa Davida hnênah a pe ta a ni.
  </para>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Hebron khuaa Davida hnênah Israel mi zawng zawng chu an kal a, “I thisen zawmpui kan ni a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Saula lal a nih lai pawh khân Israel mite chu indonaah i ho ṭhin kha. Lalpa i Pathian pawhin, ‘Ka mi Israel-te hi i kaihruaiin an rorêltu i ni ang,’ tiin a tiam che kha,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Israel hotu zawng zawng chu Hebron-ah Davida hnênah an lo kal a, Davida chuan Lalpa hmaah anni nên chuan thu a thlung a, hriak an thih a, Samuela hmanga Lalpa tiam ang khân Israel-te lal a ni ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Lal Davida leh Israel-te chu an kal a, Jerusalem khua bei tûrin an han kal a; chutih lai chuan Jebus tih a ni ṭhîn. Jebus mi, a tîr aṭanga lo awmte an la awm reng a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Jebus-ho chuan, “Khuaah i lo lût thei hauh lo vang,” an lo ti a; mahse, Davida chuan Zion kulh chu a la ta a, chu kulh awmna mual chu ‘Davida khawpui’ tih a ni ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Davida khân, “Jebus mi that hmasa ber chu sipai hotu-ah ka dah ang,” a ti a. Zeruii fapa Joaba chuan khaw bei tûr chuan hma a hruai a, sipai hotu berah a ṭang ta a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Chumi kulhah chuan Davida a awm tâk avângin ‘Davida khawpui’ tih a ni ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Khaw kulh chu Milo an tih tlâng chhak lam ruama lei chhûn khahna lai aṭangin a siam ṭan a, a dang zawng chu Joaban a chhunzawm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Lal Davida chu a chak tulh tulh a, Engkim Lalpa chuan a awmpui tlat a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Hêng hi Davida sipai hmingthangte chu an ni a; anni hian Israel mi zawng zawng nên lalah an siam a, Lalpa thu ang zêlin ram an dinpui a, a ram chu an tiropui hle a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />‘Pasalṭha pathum’ an tih zînga hotu deuh ber chu Hakmon mi Jasobeama a ni. Mi zathum feiin a bei a, ṭum khatah a that vek a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Pasalṭha pathum an tih zînga pakhat leh chu Aho chi, Dodoa fapa, Eleazara a ni. Pasdamim-ah Filistia-ho leh Davida-hote an inbei a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />ani chu Davida lamṭang a ni; Barli hmuna an awm laiin Israel-te chu an tlânchhe ta mai a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />A fate nên an lo ding a, Filistia-ho chu an that a, Lalpa chuan a hnehtîr ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ni khat chu Davida awmna Adulam pûkah a pasalṭha sawmthum chu an awm ve a, Filistia rual khat chuan Refa-ho awmna phaiah bûk an khuar tlat a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Chu hmun hima Davida a awm lai chuan Filistia mite chu Bethlehem khuaah an inkulh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Davida chuan a khua Bethlehem chu a ngai hle a, “Bethlehem kawngka bula tuikhur tui min va chawisaktu awm teh sela ka va ti em,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Pasalṭha pathumte chuan Filistia sipaihote chu an tâwn tlang a, Bethlehem kulh kawngka bula tuikhur tui chu an va thâl a, Davida chu an rawn pe a; mahse, ani chuan a lo in duh lo. Lalpa hnênah a hlân a, a bun chhuak ta zâwk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />“He tui hi ka in thei lo, mi huaisen thih huamte thisen in ka ni ngawt dâwn alâwm, thih huama va chawi an ni si a,” a ti a. Chûng chu ‘Pasalṭha Pathum’ an tihte thil tih chu a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Joaba u Abisaia chu, ‘Pasalṭha sawmthum’ an tih zînga hotu ber a ni. Feiin mi zathum a bei a, a that vek a, a hming a ṭha ta hle a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />‘Pasalṭha sawmthum’ an tih zînga hmingthang ber a ni, an hotu berah a ṭang ta a. ‘Pasalṭha pathum’ an tih zîngah erawh chuan a tel pha lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Kabzeel khaw pasalṭha, Jehoiada fapa Benaia pawhin thil mak tak tak a ti. Moab chhuan êm êm milian pahnih a that a, vûr tlâk laiin a pûka sakeibaknei tawm a that bawk.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Aigupta mi pa lian tak, tawng ngaa sâng a that bawk a ni. He pa hian kechâwn tiat dâwn laia lian fei hi a hmang a, Benaia hian talhtum nên a bei a, a fei chu a chhuhsak a, chu fei chuan Aiguptapa chu a chhun hlum a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Pasalṭha sawmthum zînga mi Jehoiada fapa Benaia chuan hêng thil hi a ti a, ‘Pasalṭha sawmthum’ zîngah chuan a hming a ṭha hle a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />‘Pasalṭha pathum’ zîngah erawh chuan a tel pha lo. Davida chuan amah vêngtute hotu-ah a dah a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Pasalṭha dangte: Joaba nau Asahela te, Bethlehem mi Dodoa fapa Elhanana te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Haror mi Samota te, Pelon mi Heleza te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tekoa mi Ikesa fapa Ira te, Anathot mi Abiezera te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Husa mi Sibekaia te, Aho mi Ilaia te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Netofa mi Maharaia te, Netofa mi Baana fa Heleda te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Benjamina thlah Gibea khaw mi Ribaia fa Itaia te, Pirathon mi Benaia te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Nahale-gaas mi Huraia te, Arbat mi Abiela te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Baharum mi Asmaveta te, Saalbon mi Eliaba te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Gizon mi Hasema te, Herar mi Sagea fapa Jonathana te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Harar mi Sakara fa Ahiama te, Ura fa Elifala te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Mekerat mi Hefera te, Pelon mi Ahija te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Karmel mi Hezroa te, Ezbaia fa Naaraia te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Nathana unaupa Joela te, Hagria fa Mibhara te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Amon mi Zeleka te, Berot mi Naharaia te: ani hi Zeruii fapa Joaba râlthuam kengtu a ni;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Jatir mi Ira leh Gareba te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Hit mi Uria te, Ahlaia fa Zabada te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Siza fa Adina te: ani hi Reubena thlahte zînga hotu a ni, a chipuite a ho, mi sawmthum nên;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Maaka fa Hanana te, Mithna mi Josafata te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Asterat mi Uzia te, Aroer mi Hothama fa Sama leh Jeiela te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Tiz mi Simria fapa Jediaela leh a unau Joha te, Mahava mi Eliela te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Elnaama fa Jeribaia leh Josavia te, Moab mi Ithma te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />Eliela te, Obeda te, Mezobia mi Jaasiela te.
  </para>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Lal Saula hlauva Ziklag khuaa Davida a tlân lai khân, Saula chu an chipui Benjamin chi ni mah se, indo ṭhang sipai rinawm tak tak Benjamin chia miten an rawn pan a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ding lam leh vei lam inang rengin thal kah nân an hmang thiam a, virvawmte an vawm thei a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Gibea mi Sama fa Ahiezera leh Joasa te chuan an ho va. Chûng sipaite chu hêngte hi an ni: Azmaveta fa Jeziela leh Peleta, Anathot khaw mi Beraka leh Jehua.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />‘Pasalṭha sawmthum’ tih zînga tel sipai hmingthang Gibea mi Ismaela, Gedera mi Jeremia, Jahaziela, Johanana leh Jozabada,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Harif mi Eluzaia, Jerimota, Bealia, Semaria, Sefatia.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Kora thlah Elkana, Isia, Azarela, Joezera, Jasobeama.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Gedor mi Jerohama fa Joela, Zebadia.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Thlalêra a bîkna hmuna a awm laiin Gada thlah zînga indo ṭhang sipai hmingthang tak tak hêng mite hian an rawn pan a, phaw leh fei an hmang thiam êm êm a, sakeibaknei hlauhawm hmêl an pu a, khâm saza anga chak an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />An lal dân indawtin an hming chu: Ezera te, Obadia te, Eliaba te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Mismana te, Jeremia te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ataia te, Eliela te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Johanana te, Elzabada te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Jeremia te, Makbanaia te an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Gada thlah sipai ṭhenkhat chu sâng hotu an ni a, a thar deuhte erawh chu za hotute an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Kum tîr, thla hmasa ber, Jordan lui len laiin lui chu an rawn kai a, lui chhak leh thlang lama awmte chu an ûm darh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Benjamin leh Juda thlah mi ṭhenkhat chu Davida awmna pûkah an kal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Davida chuan a lo hmuak a, “Ka lamṭanga min pui tûra lo kal in nih chuan lâwm takin ka lo pawm ang che u; thil ṭha lo eng mah in chunga ka tih loh pawha ka hmêlmate kuta min pêk tum in nih chuan, kan pate Pathian chuan a hria a, a hrem ngei ang che u,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />An zînga hruaitu pakhat Amasaia chu Pathian thlarauvin a thuam a, hetiang hian thu a chham ta a: “I mi kan ni e, David, Jesaia fapa, I lamṭang kan ni. Thlamuanna i hnênah awm sela, I lamṭangte hnênah pawh awm sela, Pathianin ṭanpui che rawh se,” a ti a. Davida chuan a lo lâwm a, a sipai hotu-ah te a dah hlawm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Filistia mite nên Lal Saula bei tûra Davida a thawh chhuah ve lai khân Manasea thlah zînga mi sipai ṭhenkhat chu Davida lamah an ṭang a. Filistia-ho hi a pui tak tak hman lo, an lal ṭhenkhatten an ringhlel a, a pu Saula lamah a ṭan thut an hlau va, Ziklag khuaah an tîr kîr a nih kha.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Chutia a kîr lai chuan hêng Manasea thlah sipaite hian an rawn belh a ni: Adna te, Jozabada te, Jediaela te, Mikaela te, Jozabada te, Elihua te, Zilethaia te. Hêngho hi Manasea thlah zîngah sâng hotu ṭhalh an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Davida sipaiah an ṭang ta a, sipai hotu-ah te a lo dah a, sipai ṭha tak tak an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Ni tin deuhthaw mai Davida lama ṭang tûr mi an lo kal a, sipai tam tak a nei ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Lalpa thu anga Saula aia Davida chu lala siam tum, sipai râlthuam nêna Hebron khuaa Davida rawn pantu zât chu hetiang hi a ni:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Juda thlah aṭangin phaw leh fei keng mi sângruk leh zariat,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Simeona thlah zînga indo thiam tak tak sipai sângsarih leh za.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Levia chi aṭangin mi sângli leh zaruk.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Arona thlah, Jehoiada ho, mi sângthum leh zasarih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tlangvâl huai tak Zadoka leh a ṭhian sipai hotu mi sawmhnih leh pahnih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Saula chipui, Benjamina thlahte, mi sângthum (Benjamina thlah tam tak chu Saula lama ṭang an ni),
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Efraim thlah zînga hmingthang tak tak mi sînghnih leh zariat.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Jordan thlang lama awm Manasea thlah, Davida lala siam tûra thlan chhuah mi sîngkhat leh sângriat.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Isakara thlah, hotu zahnih leh an hote. Hêng hotute hian Israel-te tih tûr leh an tih hun tûr an hre êm êm a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Zebulun thlah mi sîngnga, hriam chi tinrêng hmang thiam; mi rinawm, rilru nghet pu mi an ni hlawm.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Naftalia thlah - hotu rual sângkhat leh an ho phaw leh fei keng ṭhalh mi sîngthum leh sângsarih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Dana thlah, indo thiam mi sînghnih leh sângriat leh zaruk.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Asera thlah, indo tûra inpeih reng, mi sîngli.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Jordan chhak lama awm Reuben te, Gad te leh Manasea thlah te, hriam chi tinrêng hmang thiam mi nuaikhat leh sînghnih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Hêng sipai rual, indo tûra inpeih rengte hi Davida chu Israel lala siam tum tlatin Hebron khuaah an lo kal a. Israel hnam dangte pawh Davida lala siam tûrin an lungrual hle a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Davida ho chuan ni thum chhûng an chipuite tân ruai an lo buatsaih chu an ei a, an in a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Hmâr lama awm Isakar-ho te, Zebulun-ho te, Naftali-ho te chuan chhangphut te, theipui te, grep pho ro te, uain te, oliv hriak te an rawn la a, sabengtung te, sanghâwngsei te, sakawr puakphur chi te, bâwng te an rawn phurhtîr zut zut a. Talh tûr berâm te, bâwng te an rawn khalh zut zut bawk a. Israel ram mite chu an lâwm êm êm a ni.
  </para>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Sipai sâng hotute, za hotute leh hruaitute chu Davida chuan a berâwn a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Israel pungkhâwmho hnênah chuan “ Lalpa , kan Pathian duhzâwng a niha, nangni pawhin ṭha in tih chuan kan mi zawng zawng, khaw tina puithiam te leh Levia chi awmte hnênah mi tîr ila, hetah hian lo kal khâwm teh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Kan za-in kal ila. Pathian Thuthlung Bâwm kha i la ang u; Saula lal lai khân a ngaihsak si lo va,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Mipui chuan ṭha an ti a, lâk chu an remti ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Chhim lam Aigupta ramri aṭangin hmâr lam ramri, Hamath kalkhân thlengin Kiriat-jearim aṭanga Jerusalem-a Thuthlung Bâwm la tûr chuan Israel mite chu an ko khâwm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Davida leh mipuite chuan Judai rama Baala khua, Kiriat-jearim an tih bawkah chuan an kal a, cherub chunga ṭhu Lalpa hming chuanna Thuthlung Bâwm chu la tûrin an kal ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Abinadaba in aṭang chuan Thuthlung Bâwm chu an la chhuak a, bâwng-tawlailîr tharah an dah a, Uza leh Ahioa chuan bâwng chu an khalh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Davida leh mipuite chu Pathian chawimawiin theihtâwp chhuahin an lâm a. An zai a, ṭingṭangte an tum a, khuangtê te an vua a, darbenthek te an bêng a, tawtawrâwt te an hâm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Kidona hruih an thlen chuan bâwngte chu an inpal a, Uza chuan Thuthlung Bâwm chu a lo chelh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Thuthlung Bâwm a khawih avâng chuan Uza chungah Lalpa chu a thinur a, a tihlum ta nghâl a. Pathian hmaah chuan a thi ta a, chu lai hmun chu ‘Perez-uza’ an ti ta a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Davida chu a thinur a, Uza chu Lalpa chuan thinura a hrem avângin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Davida chuan Pathian chu a hlau ta hle a, “Thuthlung Bâwm chu ka hâwn ngam dâwn em ni?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Chuvângin, Davida chuan Thuthlung Bâwm chu Jerusalemah a hâwn ta lo va, Gath khaw mi ve rêng Obed-edoma inah a dah ṭha ta zâwk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Chutah chuan thla thum a awm a, Obed-edoma te chhûngkua leh an thil neih zawng zawngte chu Lalpan mal a sâwm a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="14" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Insumdâwn tawn thuah Tura lal Hirama chuan Davida hnênah palai a tîr a. Lal in sak nân sidar thingtumte a pe a, lungchher thiam te leh thing dek thiam mistiri a ngaihtuahsak bawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Lalpa chuan Israel-te chunga a lalna chu a tinghetin a mi Israel-te avângin a ram pawh a chawimawi ta hle tih Davida chuan a hria a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Davida chuan Jerusalem-ah nupui tam tak a neih belh a, fanu fapa pawh a neih belh ṭeuh bawk.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Jerusalem-a a fate chu hêngte hi an ni: Samua, Sobaba, Nathana, Solomona,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ibhara, Elisua, Elpeleta,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Noga, Nefega, Jafia,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Elisama, Beeliada, Elifeleta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Filistia mite chuan Davida chu Israel ram pumah a lal ta tih an hriatin amah chu man tumin an sipaite an tîr a. Davida chuan a lo hriatin bei lêt tûrin a thawk chhuak a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Filistia sipaite chuan Refa-ho ruam an tih chu an lo thleng a, mite chu an rawk ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Davida chuan, “Filistia-ho hi ka bei ang em? Min hnehtîr ang em?” tiin Pathian a râwn a. Lalpa chuan, “Bei rawh, ka hnehtîr ang che,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Davida chuan Baal-Perazim-ah a bei a, a hneh ta a. “Hmêlma sipaite chu tuilian hrût ang hrimin Pathianin min sawisaktîr hi,” a ti a. Chu hmun chu Baal-Perazim an vuah ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Filistia-ho chuan an pathian lemte chu an tlânchhiatsan a, Davida chuan a hâltîr vek a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Rei lo tê hnuah, chu hmunah bawk chuan Filistia-ho an lo kal leh a, chûng lai mite chu an rawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Davida chuan Pathian a râwn leh a, Ani chuan, “He lam aṭang hi chuan bei mai suh, râl lehlama thingtheihmu hmunah sâwn kal kual la, chuta ṭang chuan bei ang che,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Thingtheihmu lêra kal thâwm ang ri ṭhup ṭhup i hriat veleh chê ang che. Filistia sipaite sawisa tûrin i hnênah ka lo kal dâwn a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Pathian thupêk ang chuan Davida chuan a ti a, Gibeon aṭangin Gezer thleng rawkin Filistia-ho chu a ûm ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Davida hming chu ram tinah a thang ta a, Lalpa vângin hnam tinin an hlau a ni.
  </para>
  <chapter number="15" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Davida chuan ama chên nân “Davida khawpuiah” in a sa hlawm a. Pathian Thuthlung Bâwm dahna tûr hmun a buatsaih a, puan in a kaih bawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Levia chi chauhvin Thuthlung Bâwm chu an zâwn tûr a ni, a zâwntu atân leh kumkhuaa a rawngbâwltu atân Lalpa chuan anni hi a thlang a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Davida chuan Israel mi zawng zawng chu Jerusalem-ah, Thuthlung Bâwm dahna tûr a buatsaihah chuan dah tûrin a pun khâwm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Arona thlah leh Levia chite chu a ko khâwm a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Levia chi, Kohata thlahte chu mi za leh sawmhnih, Uriela hovin an lo kal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Meraria thlah aṭangin mi zahnih leh sawmhnih, Asaia hovin an lo kal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Gersona thlah aṭangin mi za leh sawmthum, Joela hovin an lo kal a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Elizafana thlah aṭangin mi zathum, Semaia hovin an lo kal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Hebrona thlah aṭangin mi sawmriat, Eliela hovin an lo kal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Uziela thlah aṭangin mi za leh sâwm leh pahnih, Aminadaba hovin an lo kal bawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Davida chuan puithiam Zadoka leh Abiathara chu a ko va, Levia chi mi paruk, Uriela te, Asaia te, Joela te, Semaia te, Eliela te, Aminadaba te pawh chu a ko va,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />an hnênah, “Levia chi hruaitute in ni a, inthian thianghlim ula, in Levia chipuite pawh thian thianghlim rawh u. Lalpa , Israel-te Pathian Thuthlung Bâwm chu a dahna tûr ka buatsaihah in zâwn thleng tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Lâk kan tum hmasak ṭum khân in tel ve lo va, Lalpa kan Pathian chu a tih dân tûr kan râwn lo va, min sawisa ta a nih kha,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Lalpa , Israel-te Pathian Thuthlung Bâwm la sawn tûr chuan puithiamte leh Levia chite chu an inthian thianghlim ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Mosia hnêna Lalpa sawi angin Levia chite chuan bâwm chu a zâwnfungin an zâwn ta a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Levia chite chu zaipâwl te, perhkhuang tuma dârbenthek bêng pâwl te insiam tûrin an hotute chu Davida chuan a hrilh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Dârbenthek ring taka bêng tûrin hêng mite hi an ti a:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Joela fapa Hemana te, a unau Berekia fapa Asafa te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />an unau Meraria thlah zînga mi Kusaia fapa Ethana te.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Anniho hi ṭanpuia perhkhuang fiak chi perh tûrin hêng Levia chite hi an ruai a: Zekaria, Aziela, Semiramota, Jehiela, Unia, Eliaba, Maaseia, Benaia.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Perhkhuang ri thum perh tûrin Levia chi hêngte hi an thlang chhuak: Matithia, Elifelehua, Mikneia, Azazia, Tempul pulis Edoma leh Jeiela te nên.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Kenania chu thil tum thiam tak a ni a, Levia chi, rimawi tumtute chu an hotîr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Berekia leh Elkana chu Obed-edoma leh Jehia nên Thuthlung Bâwm vêngtuah an ruat a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Puithiam Sebania te, Josafata te, Nethanela te, Amasaia te, Zekaria te, Benaia te, Eliezara te chu Thuthlung Bâwm hmaa kal a, tawtawrâwt hâmtuah an thlang a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Lal Davida te, Israel upa te leh Sipai sâng hotute chu Obed-edoma inah Thuthlung Bâwm la tûr chuan hlim takin an kal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Lalpa chuan Levia chi, Thuthlung Bâwm zâwntu tûrte a ṭanpui duh nân a hnênah bâwngpa pasarih leh berâm pasarih an hlân a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Davida chuan puan zai sîn ṭha ber chi a sin a, hla satute pawh, an hotu Kenania leh Bâwm zâwntute nên chutiang chuan an inthuam a; Davida chuan puan zai sîn Efod a inbel bawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Israel mi zawng zawng chu hlim takin an au va, tawtawrâwt te, berâm kîte an hâm a, dârbenthek te an bêng a, perkhuang te perh chungin Thuthlung Bâwm chu Jerusalem-ah an chhawm chho ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Khuaa Bâwm an zâwn luh lai chuan Saula fanu Mikali chuan tukverhah a lo thlîr a, Lal Davida lâwma a lâm leh a zuang vêl chu a zu hmu a, a hmusit rilru hle a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="16" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Thuthlung Bâwm chu Davida buatsaih puan inah chuan an zâwn lût a, an dah ta a. Lalpa hnênah hâlral thilhlan leh remna thilhlan an hlân a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Davida chuan thilhlan a tih zawh chuan Lalpa hmingin mipui tân malsâwmna a sawi a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />ei tûr a sem vek a, Israel rama mi zawng zawng, mipa pawh, hmeichhia pawh, chhang tlang khat leh sa hem hmin hrang khat, grep pho ro tlêm nên a pe ṭheuh va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Thuthlung Bâwm hmaa Lalpa biakna hruaia, fakna hla sa tûrin Levia chi mi ṭhenkhat chu Davida chuan a ruat a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Asafa chu an hotu ber a ni; Zekaria chu a dawttu a ni; Jeiela te, Semiramota te, Jehiela te, Matithia te, Eliaba te, Benaia te, Obed-edoma te, Jeiela te chu perhkhuang leh ṭingṭang tum tûr an ni a, Asafa chu dârbenthek ring taka bêngtu tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Puithiam pahnih, Benaia leh Jahaziela chu Thuthlung Bâwm hmaa a khât tâwka tawtawrâwt hâm ṭhîn tûra ruat an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Asafa leh a Levia chipuite Lalpa fakna hla sak kaihruaitu atâna ruat hmasa bertu chu Davida hi a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Lalpa chu lâwmthu hrilh ula, A hming lam bawk rawh u. A thiltih hi hnam tinrêng hrilh rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Amah fakin zai ula, Thil mak a tih zawng zawng hi hril rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />A hming thianghlim hi chhuang ula, Lalpa zawngtute chu hlim hle rawh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Lalpa chu zawng ula, a chakna dîl rawh u. Ani chu pan fo rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />A thiltih ropui tak te, Thil mak a tih leh a rorêl dân te chu, Hre reng rawh u,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Aw, a chhiahhlawh Israela thlahte leh A thlan Jakoba fate u, hre reng rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ani chu Lalpa kan Pathian a ni, Khawvêl pum puia rorêltu a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />A thuthlung chu hre reng rawh u, Chhuan sâng tâna a thupêk chu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Abrahama hnêna a thuthlung leh Isaka hnêna a thutiam chu a hre reng a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Chûng chu Jakoba thlahte Dân atân a nemnghet a, Israel-te kumkhaw thuthlung atân.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />“Khai le, Kanan ram hi ka pe ang che u, Ro atân in nei thliah ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Eng tham ni lo, mi tlêm tê, Mikhual mai an nih lai pawh khân,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Hnam tinrêng zînga vâkvaiin, Khaw tin chhiarin an pêm ṭhîn a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Mahse, tu ma nêkchêp a phal lo va, Anmahni avângin lalte a zilh zâwk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />“Ka hriakthih hi khawih suh ula, Ka zâwlnei hi a pawi khawih hek suh u,” a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Khawvêla mi zawng zawngte u, Lalpa fakin hla sa ula, Min chhandam thu lâwmawm hi ni tin puang rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />A ropuizia hnam tin hnênah hril ula, Mi tin hnênah thil mak a tihte chu puang rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Lalpa chu a ropui a, fak chiam tûr a ni, Pathian dang zawng zawng aiin zah tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Hnam dang pathiante chu a lem mai an ni a, Lalpa hi zawng vân siamtu a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Ropuina leh chawimawina chuan a hual vêl a, A Hmun Thianghlim chu thiltihtheihna leh lâwmnain a khat.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Khawvêla hnam tinrêngte u, Lalpa chu chawimawi ula, Lalpa ropuina leh chakna chu fak rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Lalpa hming ropui chu fak fo ula, Thilpêk kengin a inah lo haw rawh u, Thianghlim leh mawia inthuamin Lalpa hmaah lo kûn rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Lei mi zawng zawngte u, a hmaah khûr ula, Lei pawh hi a nghîn theih lohna tûrin tihngheh a ni si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Vânte u, hlim ula, aw leilung, nang pawh lâwm rawh, Lalpa hi lal a nih hnam tin hrilh rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Tuifinriat leh a chhûnga awmte chu au dur dur rawh se, Ram leh a chhûnga awm zawng zawng hlim se,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Ngawa thing zawng zawng pawh au hluah hluah rawh se, Leia rorêl tûra a lo kal hunah chuan.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Lalpa chu a ṭhat êm avângin lâwmthu hrilh rawh u, Ngil a nei kumkhua si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Aw Lalpa , kan Pathian, min chhan chhuak la, Hnam dang zîng ata min hruai khâwm leh ang che. I hming thianghlim kan fak ang a, Ropui takin kan chawimawi ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Lalpa , Israel-te Pathian chu fak ula, Chatuan chatuanin fak rawh u. Mi zawng zawng chuan, ‘Amen,’ an lo ti a. Lalpa chu an fak a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Lalpa Thuthlung Bâwm an dahna hmuna Pathian biaknaa rawngbâwltuah Asafa leh a chipui Levia chite chu Davida chuan a dah nghet a, ni tin hnaah an neih ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Jeduthuna fapa leh a chipui mi sawmruk leh pahnih chuan an pui ṭhîn a ni. Hosia leh Obed-edoma chu kawngkhâr vêngtu an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Puithiam Zadoka leh a puithiampui dangte chu Lalpa an biakna hmun Gibeon khuaah chuan inkhâwmna hruaitu an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Israel-te hnêna Lalpa thupêk, Lalpa dân bu-a ziak angin tûk leh zân maichâmah hâlral thilhlan an hâl ṭhîn tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Hemana leh Jeduthuna pawh, mi dang thlan chhuahte nên an awm ve a, a hmangaihna dai ngai lo avânga Lalpa fak hla sa tûr an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Fakna hla an sak lo rem tûr tawtawrâwt te, dârbenthek te leh rimawi tumtute hotu chu Hemana leh Jeduthuna te hi an ni. Jeduthuna chipuite chu kawngkhâr vêngtu an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Mi tin mahni in lamah an haw a, Davida pawh a chhûngte uap tûrin a hâwng a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="17" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Lal Davida chu inah a awm ta deuh reng a. Ni khat chu zâwlnei Nathana a ko va, a hnênah, “Sidar thinga sak inah ka awm a, Lalpa Thuthlung Bâwm lah puan in mai maiah a awm si,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Nathana chuan, “I vei rilrûk ang chu ti ta che, Pathianin a awmpui zêl ang che,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Nimahsela, chumi zân chuan Pathianin Nathana hnênah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />“Kal ta la, ka chhiahhlawh Davida hnênah ka thu hi va hrilh rawh, ‘Nang zawng, ka chênna tûr Tempul satu tûr i ni lo ve.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Israel mite Aigupta ram ata ka hruai chhuah aṭanga tûn thleng hian tempulah ka la awm ngai lo. Puan in mai maiah hlîr ka awm a, hmun hrang hrangah ka insawn ka insawn ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Israel mite ka kalpui ṭhin laite khân, hruaitua ka ruat tu mah, sidar thinga Tempul min siamsak tûrin ka phût ngai lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />“ ‘Chuvângin, ka chhiahhlawh Davida chu hrilh rawh; Kei, Engkim Lalpa hnênah, ‘phûla i berâm vêng lai ka la che a, ka mi Israel-te lalah ka siam ta che a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />I kalna apiangah ka awmpui che a, i do, i hmêlma zawng zawngte chu ka hnehtîr zêl che a, khawvêla lal hmingthang berah ka siam dâwn che a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tu man an tihduhdah tawh lohna tûr hmun, ka mi Israel-te tân ka thlang a, ka awmtîr tawh a, mi kawlh pui puiin an bei ṭhîn a; mahse, an bei tawh lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ka mi Israel-te tân chuan rorêltute ka ruatsak a. I hmêlma zawng zawng hnehpui che leh thlah tam tak pêk che ka tiam a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />I thih hunah, i pate hnêna i kal hnu chuan i fate zînga pakhat chu lalah ka siam ang a, ka tilal êm êm ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ani chuan in mi saksak dâwn a ni, kumkhuaa lal tûrin ka dah nghet ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />A pa ka ni ang a, ka fapa a ni bawk ang. I lal hmaa lal ka hawisan ang khân ka hawisan lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ka mite leh ka ram chunga rorêltuah ka dah ang a, a thlahte ngeiin lalṭhutthlêng chu an chhawm zêl ang,’ ” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Pathianin thu a hrilh leh a sawi zawng zawng chu Nathana chuan Davida a hrilh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Lal Davida chu Biakbûkah chuan a kal a, a ṭhu a, a ṭawngṭai a, “Aw Lalpa Pathian, kei leh ka chhûngte tehlul hi engtizia nge heti taka min duat le?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Chu chu tâwk ti mai lovin ka thlahte pawh la tihṭhat zêl i tiam lehnghal a; a ni, aw Lalpa Pathian, mi ropui tak angin min cheibâwl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Eng nge ka ngen leh chuan ang? I chhiahhlawh hi i hre tlang vek a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Aw Lalpa , i chhiahhlawh hi ka ṭhatna tûrin, nangma thu ngeiin min chawimawi i tum a lo ni; ka thlahte pawh i chawimawi zêl dâwn tih min hrilh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Aw Lalpa , kan hriat phâkah chuan nang ang tu mah an awm lo va, nang chauh hi Pathian chu i ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Israel mite ang pawh hi khawvêlah hnam dang an awm lo; bawih ata i tlan a, Aigupta ram ata i hruai chhuak a, thil ropui leh mak tak tak tiin khawvêl pumah i hming i chher tâk hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Israel mite chu i mi ni kumkhua tûrin i ti ta a, Aw Lalpa , nang hi an Pathian chu i nih tâk ngei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />“Khai le, aw Lalpa , kei leh ka thlahte chungthua i thutiam hi i duh ang angin han tipuitling teh le.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />I hming a lo ropui ang a, i mite chuan ‘Engkim Lalpa hi Israel-te tân zawng Pathian a lo nih ngei hi,’ an ti dâwn nia. Ka lalna pawh hi kumkhua atân i tinghet dâwn a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />I chhiahhlawh chu hêng thil hi i hrilha, ka thlahte pawh an lal zêl dâwn tih i sawi avângin i hnênah hêng hi ka rawn sawi ngam a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Nang zawng, Aw Lalpa , Pathian i ni a, he thil ropui tak hi min tihsak i tiam ta si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />An chunga ngil i neih zêlna tlâk an nih theih nân ka thlahte hi malsâwm la. Aw Lalpa , nang chuan mal i sâwm tawh a, i malsâwmna chu an chungah awm reng rawh se,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="18" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Nakin deuhvah chuan Filistia-ho chu Davida chuan a rûn a, a hneh a, Gath khawpui leh a vêl khuate chu a chhuhsak a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Moab-ho pawh a hneh a, a thuhnuaiah an awm a, a hnênah chhiah an chawi ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Hamath dep, Zoba lal Hadadezera chuan Eufretis lui hmâr lam ram neih a tum a, a beih avâng hian Davida chuan a rûn a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Davida chuan a sakawr-tawlailîr sângsarih leh sakawr chuang mi sângsarih leh kea kal sipai sînghnih a mansak a. Tawlailîr za hnûk thei tûr sakawr chu a zuah a, a dang chu an tha a chhahsak a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Suria mi, Damaska lal chuan Hadadezera chu pui tûrin sipai a tîr a. Davida chuan a lo bei a, sipai sînghnih leh sânghnih a lo thahsak a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Suria ramah chuan sipai a dah a, Davida khualehtui an ni ta a, a hnênah chhiah an chawi a, Lalpa chuan Davida chu kil tinah a tichak zêl a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Hadadezera ho rangkachak phawte chu a lâksak a, Jerusalem-ah a hâwn a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Hadadezera khua Tibhat leh Kun khua aṭang pawhin dâr tam tak a la a, chûng chuan Solomonan Tempula tuizêm te, dâr ban te, leh bêl te a siam a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Hamath lal Toia chuan Hadadezera leh a sipaite chu Davidan a hneh tih a lo hria a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Toia leh Hadadezera hi an indo fo tawh ṭhîn a, Davida hian a hneh tâk avângin lo hmuak tûr leh lâwmpui tûrin a fapa Jorama chu Toia chuan a tîr a. Jorama chuan rangkachak te, tangkarua te leh dâra siam thil tam tak te a pe a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Davida chuan, Edom-ho te, Moab-ho te, Amon-ho te, Filistia-ho te leh Amalek-ho te a chhuhsak, rangkachak te, tangkarua te leh dâr te chu Tempul sak nân a pe vek a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Zeruii fapa Abisaia chuan Chikhur ruamah Edom-ho sîngkhat leh sângriat a that a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Edom ramah chuan sipai a dah thluah a, Davida khualehtui an ni ta a. Lalpa chuan Davida chu khawiah pawh a tichak ta zêl a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Davida chu Israel zawng zawng lal a ni ta a; tu mah hleih nei lovin ro a rêlsak ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Zeruii fapa Joaba chu sipai hotu lal ber a ni a, Ahiluda fapa Jehosafata chu Ziaktu lian a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ahituba fapa Zadoka leh Abiathara fapa Abimeleka chu puithiam hotu an ni; Seraia chu ziaktu a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Jehoiada fapa Benaia chu Keret leh Pelet, lal vêngtute hotu a ni. Lal Davida fapate pawh ram chhûnga mi lian tak tak an ni.
  </para>
  <chapter number="19" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tin, Amon-ho lal Nahasa chu a thi a, a fapa chuan a ai a awh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Davida chuan, “Khawi nge, Nahasa khân min khawngaih a, a fapa Hanuna khawngaih hi ka ba ve a ni,” a ti a, a pa râl tûrin mi a tîr a. Hanuna râl tûr chuan Davida chhiahhlawhte chu an kal a, Amon-ho rama Hanuna in chu an va thleng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Amon milianho chuan Hanuna hnênah, “Davida hian i pa hi sûn tak taka râl tûr chein mi a rawn tîr niin i ring em ni? Kan ram hi an lâk mai theih nân a chhiahhlawhte hi en thlithlai tûrin a rawn tîr a ni zâwk dâwn lâwm ni?” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Davida palaite chu Hanuna chuan a man a, an hmuihmul a ziahkâwnsak a, an kawrfual chu a kâwng chinah a tansak bawk a, a hâwntîr leh ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />An lo sawisak dân chu Davida hrilh tûrin mi an tîr a, anmahni chu an zak lutuk a, lal hnênah chuan an kal hreh a ni. Davida chuan, “Jeriko khuaah awm ula, in hmuihmul a chawr buk leh deuh hunah in lo haw dâwn nia,” tiin mi a chah a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Lal Hanuna leh Amon mite chuan Davida thinurzia an hriat chuan Mesapotamia rama mi te, Suria rama Maaka leh Soba mite chu sakawr-tawlailîr leh sakawr chungchuang rawih nân tangka kg. sîngthum leh sângli an pe a. Tawlailîr sîngthum leh sânghnih an ruai a, chu nên chuan Maaka lal leh a sipaite chuan Medeba bulah bûk an rawn khuar a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Amon mite pawh khaw tin aṭangin indo tûrin an lo thawk chhuak a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Chu chu Davida chuan a lo hria a, a sipai hotu Joaba chu a ko va, a sipai huaisen rual pawh chu a ko khâwm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Amon-ho chu an insiam a, an lal awmna khawpui Raba kulh pâwnah ṭanhmun an siam a; an lama ṭang tûr lalte leh sipai lo thawkte chuan ram palailêngah ṭanhmun an siam a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Joaba chuan hma lamah leh hnung lamah hmêlmaten an rawn bei dâwn tih a hriatin a sipai ṭha zualte chu a thlang chhuak a, Suria ram aṭanga lo kal sipaite bei tûrin a tlar a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Sipai dangte chu a u Abisaia a hotîr a, Amon-ho bei tûrin an intlar a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Joaba chuan, “Suria ram mite ka hneh loh chuan min rawn pui la, Amon-ho i hneh loh chuan ka rawn pui ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />I tum tiruh la, kan mite leh kan Pathian mite awmna khuate i chhan teh ang; Lalpa chu ṭha a tih angin a lo che ang chu,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Joaba leh a mite chuan Suria mite chu an bei a, an hmaah chuan an tlânchhe ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Amon miten Suria mite an tlânchhia an hmuh chuan Joaba u Abisaia hmaah chuan an tlânchhe ve a, an khaw kulh chhûngah chuan an tlân lût a, Joaba chuan Jerusalem-ah a hâwnsan ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Suria mite chuan Israel-te chu an ngam lo tih an hriatin Eufretis lui râla Suria mi dangte chu an pun a, Zoba lal Hadadezera sipai hotu Sofaka hovin an lo thawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Chu thu chu Davida an hrilh a, Israel mite chu a khâwm a, Jordan a kân a, an awmna chu a va thleng a. Suria mite nên chuan an inbei a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Suria mite chu Israel-te hmaah chuan an tlânchhia a, Davida chuan tawlailîr khalhtu sângsarih a that a, kea kal sipai sîngli nên; an hotu Sofaka pawh chu a that a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Hadadezera hote chuan Israel-te chu an ngam lo a ni tih an hriat chuan Davida nên an inberem a, a khua leh tuiah an awm ta a; Amon-ho pawh an pui duh tawh lo.
  </para>
  <chapter number="20" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Kum a lo thar a, nipui a lo thaw dâwn a, lalhote rammut ṭhin hun chu a lo thleng a. Joaba chuan sipai a hruai a, Amon-ho ram chu a va rûn a. Lal Davida erawh chu Jerusalem-ah a awm rih a. Raba khua chu an hual a, an bei a, an tichhe ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />An pathian lim Milkoma lukhum chu rangkachak kg. sawmthum leh pali laia rit a ni a, chutah chuan lunghlu pawh an phûm nual a; chûng chu Davida chuan a lallukhumah chuan a phûm a; khua aṭang chuan thil tam tak, râllâk sumah a la a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Khuaa mite chu a kawi a, thingzaiah te, leiletah te leh hreia thing tanah te a chhawr a. Amon khaw danga mite pawh chutiang bawk chuan a chhawr a. A hote nên Jerusalem-ah Davida chu a kîr leh ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Nakin deuhvah chuan Filistia mite nên Gezer-ah an indo leh a, Hamath mi Sibekaia chuan Filistia mi zînga milian thlah Sifaia a that a, Filistia-ho chu an tlâwm ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Filistia mite nên an inbei leh a, Jaira fapa Elhanana chuan Goliatha nau Lahmia, Gath khaw mi chu a that a; chu mi fei chu kechâwn tiat dâwn laia hrawl a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Gath khuaah hian an inbei leh a. Milian pakhat, kutzungṭang paruk leh kezungṭang paruk ve ve nei a awm a, hmânlai miliante thlah a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Israel-te chu a cho vei a, Davida u Sama fapa Jonathanan a that a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Davida leh a hote thah miliante hi Gath khuaa awm milian thlah an ni.
  </para>
  <chapter number="21" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Setana chuan Israel-te sawisak a duh a, Davida chu Israel-te chhiarpui a neihtîr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Joaba leh hotu dangte hnênah, “Israel ram hi a kil tâwp Beer-seba aṭanga Dan thlengin fang chhuak ula, Israel mi eng zât nge awm ka hre duh a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Joaba chuan, “ Lalpa hian tûna awm lêt za aia tam Israel-te chu awmtîr teh se. Ka pu, i mite vek an ni a, engtizia nge hetiang thil tih hi i duh a, hnam pumin thiam loh kan chan ang?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Nimahsela, lal thu chu a tlang ta zâwk a. Joaba chuan Israel ram chu a fang chhuak a, Jerusalem-ah a lo haw leh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Joaba chuan Israel mi zât chu a hrilh a, “Sipaia ṭang thei mi maktaduaikhat leh nuaikhat Israel ramah an awm a, Judai ramah mi nuai li leh sîngsarih an awm,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Lal thu chu ṭha a tih loh avângin Joaba chuan Levia chite leh Benjamin chite a chhiar tel ve lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />An thiltih avâng chuan Pathian chu a lâwm lo va, Israel mite chu a hrem a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Davida chuan Pathian hnênah, “Thil ka tisual nasa a, a âtthlâk hle a ni, min ngaidam rawh,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Lalpa chuan Davida zâwlnei Gada hnênah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />“Kal la, ‘Kawng thum, a eng ber emaw a thlan tûr ka ruatsak a ni; a thlan ber chu ka tihsak dâwn’ tih Davida chu va hrilh rawh,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Gada chu Davida hnênah a kal a, Lalpa thu sawi chu a hrilh a, “A eng nge i duh ber thlang rawh le,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />kum thum ṭâm tuar nge, thla thum hmêlma ûm nge, ni thum Lalpa Vantirhkohvin Israel ram pum khandaiha a sawisaka, hri-a a hrem? Mi tîrtu Lalpa chu engtin nge ka chhân dâwn?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Davida chuan Gada chu a chhâng a, “A ngaihna ka va hre lo ve! Mihring kut tuar zawng ka duh lo, Lalpa kut tuar ka thlang zâwk e, ani chuan ngil a nei si ṭhîn a,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tichuan, Israel-te zîngah hri a rawn lêntîr a; mi sîngsarih an thi a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Lalpa chuan Jerusalem tichhe tûrin Vântirhkoh a rawn tîr bawk a; mahse, a duh leh ta lo va, Vântirhkoh hnênah chuan, “A tâwk e, ti tawh suh,” a ti a. Jebus mi Arauna hruihah chuan Vântirhkoh chu a ding a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Davida chuan a han en a, Jerusalem tichhe tûr Vântirhkoh khandaih keng, lei leh vân inkâra ding chu a hmu a, Davida leh mipui hruaitute chuan saiip puan an sin vek a, hmaia lei siin an kûn a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Davida chu a ṭawngṭai a, “Aw Pathian, thil sual titu chu kei hi ka ni; chhiarpui kha keima tihtîr a ni; hêng mipui, eng mah ti ve lote hian tihsual an nei hlei nêm. Kei leh ka chhûngte hi min hrem mai ta che, I mite hi chu zuah rawh,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Lalpa Vântirhkoh chuan Gada hnênah, “Davida chu Jebus mi Arauna hruihah maichâm siam tûrin hrilh rawh,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Davida chuan Lalpa thu chu a zâwm a, Gada sawi ang chuan a kal ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Hruihah chuan Arauna leh a fapa pali chuan huit an lo vua a, Vântirhkoh an hmuh chuan a fate chu an biru a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Araunan Davida lo kal a hmuh chuan hruih ata chu a lo kal a, bawkkhupin chibai a lo bûk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Davida chuan, “Hri hi a reh theih nân i hruihah hian maichâm ka siam ang e, min leitîr rawh, a man tûr chu ka pe ang che,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Arauna chuan, “Ka pu, nei mai rawh, ṭha i tih ang angin ti rawh. Maichâma thilhlan tûr hei bâwngpa a awm a, a hâlna tûr thing pawh buh vuakna hmanrua a awm a; chhangphut thilhlan tûr huit pawh hi ka pe a che, engkim ka tum vek ang e,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Lal Davida chuan a chhâng a, “Ni lo ve, a man dik tak ka pe ang che, Lalpa hnêna thilhlan atân i ta eng mah a thlâwnin ka la lo vang; a man pe lovin hâlral thilhlan tûr pawh ka hlân lo vang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Davida chuan Arauna chu a hruih manah rangkachak tangka zaruk a pe ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Chumi hmunah chuan Lalpa tân maichâm a siam a, hâlral thilhlan leh remna thilhlan a hlân a. A ṭawngṭai a, Lalpa chuan a rawn chhâng a, maichâma hâlral thilhlan chu vân aṭanga meiin a rawn kâng ral ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Lalpa chuan Vântirhkoh chu a khandaih dah bo tûrin a hrilh a, a thu ang chuan a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Lalpa chuan a ṭawngṭaina a rawn chhâng a ni tih Davida chuan a hria a, Arauna hruiha maichâmah chuan thilhlan a hlân ṭhîn ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Chutih lai chuan Biakbûk leh thilhlanna maichâm Mosia siam chu Gibeon-ah a la awm a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />mahse, Lalpa khandaih tuar a hlauh avângin Pathian be tûrin chutah chuan Davida chu a kal ngam lo va ni.
  </para>
  <chapter number="22" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Davida chuan, “He laiah hian Lalpa , Pathian Tempul chu a awm tûr a ni. He lai maichâm hi a ni Israel-ten hâlral thilhlan an hlan ṭhinna tûr chu,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />A ram chhûnga hnam dang awm zawng zawng chu Davida chuan a ko khâwm a, hnathawkah a chhawr a. Ṭhenkhat chuan Tempul sakna tûr lung an chher a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />A kawngkhâra hman tûr thîrkilhna te, kawpza te, thîr tam tak leh dâr tam tak, bûk chhuah sên loh a chhertîr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tura leh Sidon mite chu sidar thing tam tak rawn tawlh tûrin a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Davida chuan, “Ka fapa Solomona sak tûr Tempul chu ropui tak, khawvêla hmingthang tham a ni tûr a ni. A la naupang a, chinchâng a la hre tâwk lo va, a châk ka lo chhuahsak tûr a ni,” a ti rilru a. Tichuan, a thih hmain Tempul sakna tûr châk tam tak Davida chuan a lo chhêk khâwm hman a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />A fapa Solomona chu a ko va, Lalpa , Israel-te Pathian tân Tempul saksak tûrin a hrilh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Davida chuan, “Kei pawhin ka Pathian, Lalpa hminga in sak chu ka châk êm êm a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />amaherawhchu, Lalpa chuan ‘Thisen i chhuah nasa êm a, indo lah i uar si. Nangmah avângin leia thisen luang ka hmu tam êm mai; nang chuan ka in chu i sa lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Inrem ngaina tak fapa Solomona i nei a, a hming hi ‘muanna’ tih a nih ang ngei hian a vêla a hmêlmate lakah thlamuang takin ka awmtîr ang a, a lal chhûngin Israel ram a râlmuang ang a, thlamuang takin an awm ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ani chuan ka in tûr chu a sa ang a, ka tân fapa a ni ang a, a tân pa ka ni bawk ang; Israel-te chunga a lalṭhutthlêng chu kumkhua atân ka tinghet ang,’ tiin mi hrilh a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />“Chuvângin, ka fapa, Lalpa chu i hnênah awm sela, malsâwm che sela, a tih ang ngei chuan Lalpa i Pathian in tûr chu sa rawh le;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Finna leh hmang hriatna pe phawt mai che sela, Israel mite chu Lalpa , i Pathian dân hmangin ro i rêlsak thei ang a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Israel-te tâna Lalpa thuruatte leh a Dân, Mosia a hrilhte kha zâwm la, kawng engkimah i hlawhtling ang. Huai takin ṭan la sauh sauh rawh; hlauthâwng suh la, beidawng mai hek suh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Lalpa in sak nân rangkachak quintal nuaithum leh sângli, tangkarua quintal nuaithum leh sîngli ka lo khâwl hrâm hrâm tawh a, dâr leh thîr phei chu bûk sên a ni lo; thing leh lung pawh ka la ṭeuh tawh, lâk belh erawh chu a la ngai ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Hnathawk tûr mi tam tak an awm a; lungchher mi te, thing dek mi te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />rangkachak te, tangkarua te, thîr leh dâr chher thiam tak takte pawh an tam mai. Hma la ṭan rawh le, Lalpa chuan malsâwm che rawh se,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Davida chuan Solomona pui tûrin Israel hruaitute chu a hrilh a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />“ Lalpa , in Pathian chuan a awmpui che u a, kil tin kil tangah râlmuang takin a awmtîr che u hi. He rama lo awm ṭhînte chu Lalpa chuan min tukdawltîr a, ram hi in thuhnuaia awm a nih tâk hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />In rilru zawng zawngin Lalpa , in Pathian rawng chu tihtakzetin bâwl rawh u. Lalpa Thuthlung Bâwm leh Pathian bungbêl thianghlim dahna in tûr sa rawh u le,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="23" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Davida chu a upain a tar ta hle a. Solomona chu Israel-te lalah a dah ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Israel hruaitute, puithiamte leh Levia chi zawng zawngte chu Davida chuan a ko khâwm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Levia chi, kum sawmthum chin chung lam chu a chhiar a, mi sîngthum leh sângriat an tling.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Mi sînghnih leh sângli chu Tempul sak hna enkawltuah a dah a; mi sângruk chu thil ziak fela thubuaite rem tûrin a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Mi sângli chu pulis hna thawk tûrin a ti a; mi sângli dang chu lalin a pêk thil tum rîk theihte tuma Lalpa fak hla sa ṭhîn tûrin a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Davida chuan Levia chite chu an thlahtu athuin pâwl thumah a ṭhen a, Gerson te, Kohat te, Merari pâwlte an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Gersona khân fapa - pahnih Ladana leh Simeia a nei a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ladana chuan fapa pathum - Jehiela te, Zethama te, Joela te a nei a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Hêngho hi Ladana thlah chi hrang hrang hruaitute an ni ta a (Simeia chuan fapa pathum - Selemota te, Haziela te, Harana te a nei a).
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Simeia thlahte chu a upat dân indawtin hêngte hi an ni: Jahata, Zina, Jeusa, Beria.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Hêng mi palite hi Simeia fate chu an ni a. Jahata chu hotu ber a ni a, Ziza chu a dawttu a ni; Jeusa leh Beria hian fa an ngah lo va, thlah khat anga chhiar an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Kohata hian fapa pali - Amrama te, Izara te, Hebrona te, Uziela te a nei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Amrama hi Arona leh Mosia pa a ni. Arona hi a thlahte nên, Lalpa biaknaa rimtui hâltu, thilhlante hlâna bungraw thianghlim enkawltu leh Lalpa hminga mipuite tân malsâwmna sawi thîntu atân serh hran an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Pathian mi Mosia thlahte erawh chu Levia chite zînga chhiar tel an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Mosia chuan fapa pahnih - Gersoma leh Eliezara a nei a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Gersoma thlahte zînga mi lâr chu Sebuela a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Eliezara hian fapa pakhat chauh Rehabia a nei a. Rehabia erawh hi chuan fa a ngah hle.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Kohata fa upa dawttu Izara chuan fapa Selomita a nei a; ani chu an chi hotu a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Kohata fa dawt leh Hebrona chuan fapa pali - Jeria te, Amari te, Jahaziela te, Jekameama te a nei a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Kohata fa tlum Uziela chuan fapa pahnih Mika leh Isia a nei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Meraria chuan fapa pahnih - Mahlia leh Musia a nei a. Mahlia hian fapa pahnih Eleazara leh Kisa a nei a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Eleazara hian fanu chauh a nei, fapa nei lovin a thi a. A fanute hian pasalah Kisa fate an nei a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Meraria fapa Musia zâwk chuan fapa pathum - Mahlia te, Edera te, Jeremota te a nei a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Hêngho hi a chi chi leh a chhûng chhûnga an hming ziak vek, Levia thlahte chu an ni; kum sawmhnih chin chung lam tawh phawt chuan Lalpa inah thawh an nei a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Davida chuan, “ Lalpa , Israel-te Pathian chuan a mite chu râlmuang takin a awmtîr ta a; Jerusalem-ah a awm reng dâwn tawh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Levia chite tân chuan Lalpa chênna bâwkte leh bungraw dangte chu zâwn fo a ngai dâwn tawh lo,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Davida thu ang chuan Levia chi rêng rêng chu kum sawmhnih an tlinin rawngbâwla koh theih tûrin an hming ziak vek a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Hêng hnate hi an thawh tûr chu a ni: Arona thlah puithiamho Pathian biaknaa ṭanpui te, Tempul tualzâwl leh pindan chhûnga bungraw thianghlim vawn thianghlim te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Pathian tâna chhang serh hlan tûr siam te; dawidim telh loh chhang kan te, chhangphut oliv hriak nêna hmeh te, Tempula thilpêk lo lâka teh fel te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />a chhûn a zâna Lalpa ropuina faka zai te hi a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Sabat ni te, thla thar ni te leh kût nikhuaa hâlral thilhlan an hlan laia fak hla lo sa tûr mi eng emaw zât inchhâwk tûr an ruat thliah a, chûng chuan fak hla an sa reng tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Hmun Thianghlima biakbûk chu an enkawl ang a, Puithiam Arona thlah, an unaute rawng pawh an bâwlsak tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <chapter number="24" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Hêngho hi Arona thlah chi hrang hrangte chu an ni: Arona chuan fapa pali - Nadaba te, Abihua te, Eleazara te, Ithamara te a nei a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Nadaba leh Abihua hi an pa thih hmain fa nei lovin an thi a, Eleazara leh Ithamara chu puithiam an ni ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Lal Davida chuan puithiamho chu an tih tûr azirin pâwl hrang hrangah a ṭhen a. Eleazara thlah Zadoka leh Ithamara thlah Ahimelekan Davida chu an tihpui a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Eleazara thlahah hian hruaitu tûr mipa an tam zâwk avângin pâwl sawmparuk an ṭhen a, Ithamara thlahte erawh chu pâwl riatah an ṭhen a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tempula hotute leh Pathian rawngbâwl hnaa hotute an nih avângin rawngbâwltu tûr ṭhumvâwrin Eleazara leh Ithamara thlahte chu a indawtin an ruat a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Eleazara thlahte leh Ithamara thlahte chu ṭhumvâwrin hna an inchhâwk kual ṭhîn a ni. Nethanela, Levia chia mi, ziaktu chuan, lal te, a ṭhuihruai hotu lian te, puithiam Zadoka leh Abiathara fapa Ahimeleka hriatah a chhinchhiah a, puithiam zînga hotu te, Levia chi zînga hotute pawhin an hre ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Pâwl sawmhnih leh pali chuan hetianga indawtin hna an thawk diat diat tûr a ni: Jehoiariba pâwl, Jedaia pâwl,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Harima pâwl, Seorima pâwl,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Malkisa pâwl, Mijamina pâwl,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Hakosa pâwl, Abija pâwl,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Jesua pâwl, Sekania pâwl,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Eliasiba pâwl, Jakima pâwl,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Hupa pâwl, Jesebeaba pâwl,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Bilga pâwl, Imera pâwl,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Hezira pâwl, Hapizeza pâwl,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Pethahia pâwl, Jehezkela pâwl,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Jakina pâwl, Gamula pâwl,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Delaia pâwl, Maazia pâwl.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Lalpa , Israel-te Pathian thupêk anga an thlahtu Aronan tih tûr a lo ruat chu Tempula an kal hunah hian an rawn ti ṭhîn tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Levia thlah chhûngkaw dang hotute chu hêng hi an ni: Amrama thlah zînga mi Subaela thlah Jedeia te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Rehabia thlah Isia te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Izara thlah zînga mi Selomota thlah Jahata te;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Hebrona fa, a upat dân indawtin - Jeria te, Amaria te, Jahaziela te, Jakameama te;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Uziela thlah zînga mi Mika thlah Samira te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Uziela thlah zînga mi Mika unau Isia thlah Zekaria te.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Meraria thlah Mahlia te, Musia te, Jaazia te;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Jaazia hian fapa pathum - Sohama te, Zakura te, Ibria te a nei a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Mahlia hian fapa pahnih - Eleazara leh Kisa a nei a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Eleazara hian fapa a nei lo va; Kisa hian fapa pakhat Jerameela a nei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Musia hian fapa pathum - Mahlia te, Edera te, Jeremota te a nei. Hêng zawng hi Levia thlahte chu an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />An unau Arona thlahte tih dân ang khân an chhûngkaw hotu ber leh a naute zînga pakhat chuan Levia chite zînga rawngbâwltu tûr hriat nân ṭhum an vâwr ṭhîn; Lal Davida te, Zadoka te, Abimeleka te, puithiam zînga hotu te leh Levia chi zînga hotu te pawh an hriattîr ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <chapter number="25" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Lal Davida leh Levia chi zînga hotute chuan hêngho hi Pathian biak kaihruaitu atân an ruat; Asafa te, Hemana te, Jeduthuna te; ṭingṭang leh perhkhuang an tum bawk ang a, dârbenthek an bêng bawk ang; Pathian thuchah an puang ṭhîn ang. Pathian biak kaihhruainaa an tih tûr bîk ruat dân chu hetiang hi a ni:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Asafa chuan a fapa pali - Zakura te, Josefa te, Nethania te, Asarela te chu a kaihruai ang a. Lalin Pathian thu puang tûra a tih apiangin thu an sawi tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Jeduthuna chuan a fapa paruk Gedalia te, Zeria te, Jesaia te, Simeia te, Hasabia te, Matithia te a ho vang a, perhkhuang tumin Pathian thu an puang ang a, fak hla leh lâwmthu sawi hla an sa ṭhîn ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Hemana hian fapa sâwm leh pali - Bukia te, Matania te, Uziela te, Sebuela te, Jerimota te, Hanania te, Hanana te, Eliatha te, Gidaltia te, Romamti-ezera te, Josbekasa te, Malothia te, Hothira te, Mahaziota te a nei a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Hemana hi lal zâwlnei a ni a, tihropui a tiam avângin Pathianin fapa sâwm leh pali leh fanu pathum a pe a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />A fa zawng zawngte hian an pa hovin ṭingṭang te, perhkhuang te leh dârbenthek tein Tempula zai an rem thiam vek a. Asafa te, Jeduthuna te, Hemana te hi lal ruat an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Hêng mi sawmhnih leh palite hi thil tum thiam vek an ni. An chipui Levia chi dang, hla sa thiamte nên, an vaiin mipa zahnih leh sawmriat leh pariat an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />An thawh tûr hriat nân la naupang deuh emaw, upa tawh deuh emaw, zirtîrtu emaw, zirtu emaw, an zaa tân ṭhum an vâwr ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Hei hi pâwl tin hotu, an fate leh an unaute nên mi sâwm leh pahnih zêl thawh hun ruat indawt dân chu a ni: Asafa fa Josefa ho, Gedalia ho,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Zakura ho,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Isria ho,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Nethania ho,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Bukia ho,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Jesarela ho,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Jesaia ho,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Matania ho,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Simeia ho,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Azarela ho,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Hasabia ho,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Subaela ho,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Matithia ho,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Jeremota ho,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Hanania ho,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Josbekasa ho,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Hanana ho,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Malothia ho,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Eliatha ho,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Hothira ho,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Gidaltia ho,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Mahaziota ho,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Romamti-ezera ho.
  </para>
  <chapter number="26" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Levia chi, Tempul pulis-a chhawr mi hrang hrang hetiang hi an ni: Kora thlahte zînga mi Korea fapa; Asafa chhûngte zînga mi Meselemia chuan
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />fapa pasarih a nei a, an upat dân indawtin hêngte hi an ni: Zekaria, Jediaela, Zebadia, Jathniela
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Elama, Jehohanana, Eliehoenaia.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Obed-edoma pawh Pathianin mal a sâwm a, fapa pariat a nei a. Chûngte chu a upat dân indawtin: Semaia te, Jehozabada te, Joa te, Sakara te, Nethanela te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Amiela te, Isakara te, Peulethaia te an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Obed-edoma fapa upa Semaia hian fapa paruk Othnia te, Refaela te, Obeda te, Elzabada te, Elihua te, Semaia te a nei a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />An chite zîngah chuan mi âwmkhauh, mi chhuanawm tak tak an ni: a naupang pahnihte phei hi chu huai tak an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Obed-edoma thlahte aṭang hian an hna atâna mi fel tak tak mi sawmruk leh pahnih an awm.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Meselemia thlah zîngah mi tling tak tak mi sâwm leh pariat an awm.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Meraria thlah Hosa chuan fapa pali - Simria te (a fa u ber a ni lo nâ a, a pain chhûngkaw hotu-ah a ruat a ni),
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Hilkia te, Tebalia te, Zekaria te. Hosa thlah zîngah Tempul pulis sâwm leh pathum an awm.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tempul pulis-te chu an thlahtu azirin pâwl hrang hrangah an inṭhen a, Levia chi dangte ang bawkin Tempula hna thawh hun an ruatsak a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Thla tinin, an tam emaw, an tlêm emaw khawii kawngkhâr nge an vên dâwn tih hriat nân ṭhum an vâwr ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Selemia-ho chuan khawchhak kawngka an chang a, a fapa Zekaria chuan hmâr lam kawngka a chang a; Zekaria hi rorêl pâwla pa fing tak a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Obed-edoma hovin chhim lam kawngka an chang a, a fate chuan Tempul kudâm an chang a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Supima leh Hosa chuan khawthlang lam kawngka an chang a, kawng chunga Saleket kawngka an chang bawk. Hna chu a indawtin an inthawh chhâwk ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Khawchhak lam kawngkaah chuan ni tin mi paruk an ding ṭhîn a, hmâr lam kawngkaah mi pali, chhim lam kawngkaah mi pali bawk an ding a, kudâm vêng tûr ni tin mi pali; kudâm pakhat hi mi pahnihin an vêng ṭhîn a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Khawthlang lam pindante kawng bulah mi pali, pindan chhûngah vêngtu pahnih an dah bawk.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Chûng chu Kora leh Meraria thlahte vên tûr chu a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Levia chi, mi ṭhenkhat chu Tempul thawhlâwm bâwm leh thilpêk dahkhâwmna pindan enkawltu an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Gersona fapa pakhat Ladana chu ama fa Jehielia thlahte telin Gerson-ho lu ber a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />A fapa pahnih Zethana leh Joela chuan Tempul thawhlâwm bâwm leh thilpêk dahkhâwmna an enkawl a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Amrama thlah te, Izara thlah te, Hebrona thlah te leh Uziela thlah te tân pawh thawh tûr an tuk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Gersoma fapa Sebuela, Mosia tupa chu Tempul sum enkawltu lu ber a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Gersoma unaupa Eleazara vângin Selomit-ho nên an inchhûngkhat hnai hle. Eliezara chuan fapa Rehabia a nei a, ani chuan fapa Jesaia a nei a; Jesaia hian fapa Jorama a nei a, ani chuan fapa Zikria a nei a, Zikria hian fapa Selomita hi a nei a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Selomita leh a fate chuan lal Davida te, chhûngkaw hotute, chi hrang hrang hotute leh mipui hotuten Pathian tâna thilpêk an pêk khâwmte chu an lo enkawl fel a, Tempul sak nân indonaa an râllâk sumte kha an rawn pe ṭhîn a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Selomita leh a fate hian Tempula hman tûr miin an rawn pêk rêng rêng chu an lo enkawl a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Zâwlnei Samuela rawn pêk te, lal Saula pêk te, lal Davida pêk te, Nera fapa Abnera pêk te, Zeruii fapa Joaba pêkte pawh an enkawl a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Izara thlah zînga mi Kenania leh a fate chu khawpui pâwn ram awp hna an thawhtîr a; chanchin vawn ṭhat te, Israel mite thubuaite an remsak tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Hebrona thlahte zînga mi Hasabia leh a chhûngte mi sângkhat leh zasarih chu Jordan thlang lam ram awptuah an dah a, sakhaw lam thu leh vântlâng thil ngaihtuah ṭhîntu tûr an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Hebrona thlah hotu ber chu Jeria a ni. Davida lal kum sawmlinaah Hebrona thlahte chanchin hi an chhui a. He mi thlah zîngah sipai huai tak tak Gilead bial Jazer khuaah an lo awm hlawm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Jeria laichînte zîng aṭangin lal Davida chuan mi sânghnih leh zasarih, hotu fel tak tak a thlang chhuak a, Jordan lui chhak lam bial zawng zawng, Reubena thlah te, Gada thlah te leh khawchhak lam Manasea thlah te awmna bial sakhaw thil leh khawvêl thil lama ramawptuah a dah a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="27" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Israel mi zât - chhûngkaw hrang hotu te, sâng pâwl hotu te, za pâwl hotu te leh lehkha ziaktu te, lal bula sawrkâr hna thawktu pâwl khat mi sînghnih leh sângli zêl an ni; kum tluanin thla tin hotu hrang neiin an inthlâk kual ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Thla khatnaa thawk pâwl, mi sînghnih leh sângli chu Zabdiela fapa Jesobeaman a ho va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ani hi Juda fa Pereza thlaha mi a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Thla hnihnaa thawk pâwl mi sînghnih leh sângli chu Aho mi Dodaian a ho va. He pâwl hotu ber dawttu chu Miklota a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Thla thumnaa thawk pâwl, mi sînghnih leh sângli chu Puithiam Jehoiada fapa Benaian a ho va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />“Pasalṭha sawmthum’ tih zînga tel kha a ni. A fapa Amizabada chuan he pâwl hi a ho chhâwk ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Thla linaa thawk pâwl, mi sînghnih leh sângli chu Joaba nau Asahelan a ho va. A fapa Zebadia chuan he pâwl hi a ho ve bawk ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Thla nganaa thawk pâwl, mi sînghnih leh sângli chu Izra mi Samhutan a ho va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Thla ruknaa thawk pâwl, mi sînghnih leh sângli chu Tekoa khaw mi Ikesa fapa Ira-an a ho va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Thla sarihnaa thawk pâwl, mi sînghnih leh sângli chu Pelon mi Efraima thlah Helezan a ho va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Thla riatnaa thawk pâwl, mi sînghnih leh sângli chu Hosa mi Sibekaian a ho va. Ani hi Juda thlah zînga Zera thlaha mi a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Thla kuanaa thawk pâwl, mi sînghnih leh sângli chu Benjamin bial Anathot khaw mi Abiezeran a ho va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Thla sâwmnaa thawk pâwl, mi sînghnih leh sângli chu Netofa khaw mi Maharaian a ho va. Ani hi Zera thlah zînga tel ve a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Thla sâwm leh pakhatnaa thawk pâwl, mi sînghnih leh sângli chu Efraim bial Pirathon mi Benaian a ho va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Thla sâwm leh pahnihnaa thawk pâwl, mi sînghnih leh sângli chu Netofa khaw mi Othniela thlah Heldaian a ho va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Reuben thlah hotu chu Zikria fapa Eliezara a ni. Simeon thlah hotu chu Maaka fapa Sefatia a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Levia thlah hotu chu Kemuela fapa Hasabia a ni. Arona thlah hotu chu Zadoka a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Juda thlah hotu chu Davida u Elihua a ni. Isakara thlah hotu chu Mikaela fapa Omria a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Zebulun thlah hotu chu Obadia fapa Ismaia a ni. Naftalia thlah hotu chu Azriela fapa Jeremota a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Efraim thlah hotu chu Azazia fapa Hosea a ni. Khawthlang lama awm Manasea thlah hotu chu Pedaia fapa Joela a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Khawchhak lam, Gilead-a awm, Manasea thlah hotu chu Zekaria fapa Idoa a ni. Benjamin thlah hotu chu Abnera fapa Jaasiela a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Dana thlah hotu chu Jerohama fapa Azarela a ni. Chûng chu Israel hnam hrang hrang hotute chu an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Chhiarpuiah khân lal Davida chuan kum sawmhnih hnuai lam mi chu a chhiar tel ve lo; mite chu vâna arsi angin an tam ang tih Lalpa chuan a tiam tlat avângin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Zeruii fapa Joaban chhiarpui chu a ho va; mahse, a zo hman lo; chhiarpui avâng hian Pathianin Israel-te chu a sawisa a, mi eng zât chiah nge awm tih lal Davida chanchin ziaknaah pawh ziak a ni lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Lal kudâm chu Adiela fapa Azmavetan a enkawl a, khaw hrang hranga lal pual dahna inte chu Uzia fapa Jonathanan a enkawl a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Lal lova hnathawktute chu Keluba fapa Ezrian a enkawl a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Lal grep enkawltu chu Rama mi Simeia a ni. Uain dah khâwm enkawltu chu Sefam mi Zabdia a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Khawthlang lam tlâng bulṭhuta lal Oliv leh theipui huante chu Geder mi Baal-hananan a enkawl a. Oliv hriak enkawltu chu Joasa a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Saron phaia lal ran tlattîrtute chu Saron mi Sitraian a enkawl a. Phai dang danga ran tlattîrtute chu Adlaia fapa Safatan a enkawl a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Sanghâwngsei enkawltu chu Ismael mi Obila a ni. Sabengtung enkawltu chu Meronota mi Jehdeia a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Berâm leh kêl rual chu Hagri mi Jaziza enkawl a ni. Hêng mite hi Davida mi, a sum leh pai enkawltute chu an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Davida pami, Jonathana, mi fing tak, lehkha thiam tak chu thurâwntu a ni. Hakmona fapa Jehiela nên lal fate zirtîrtu an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Ahitofela chu lal thurâwntu a ni a, Ark mi Husaia chu lal ṭhian a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Ahitofela thih hnuah Benaia fapa Jehoiada leh Abiathara chu lal thurâwntute an ni; Joaba chu lal sipai hotu a ni.
  </para>
  <chapter number="28" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Davida chuan Israel upate, hnam hrang hrang hruaitute, lal bula lal hna thawka thla tina inthlâk kual pâwl, sâng chunga thuneitute, za chunga thuneitute, an hotute, lal sum leh pai leh ran enkawltute, ama fate nên, sawrkâr hna thawk zawng zawng leh pasalṭha rualte chu Jerusalem-ah a ko khâwm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Davida chu an hmaah a ding a, an hnênah, “Ka unau, ka mite u, ka thu hi ngaithla teh u. Lalpa Thuthlung Bâwm dahna, a ke nghahna tûr in sak ka châk êm êm a, châkte pawh ka la tawh a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />amaherawhchu, sipai ka ni a, thisen ka chhuah tam êm avângin Pathian chuan ka sak a phal lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Lalpa , Israel-te Pathian chuan, ka unaute zîngah ka dam chhûnga lal tûrin min thlang chhuak a, hnam hruaituah Juda thlahte hi a ruat a ni. Juda-ho zîngah kan chhûng hi min thlang a, kan chhûng zîngah kei hi min duhsak a, Israel-te lalah min siam a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Fapa ṭhahnem tâwk tak min neihtîr a, chûng zînga mi Solomona hi Lalpa rama Israel-ho chunga lal atân a thlang a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />“ Lalpa chuan ka hnênah, ‘I fapa Solomona hian ka Tempul chu a sa ang, ka fapa atân ka thlang a, a pa ka ni ang a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ka thuruatte, ka thupêkte a zawm tlat chuan a lalna chu kumkhua atân ka tinghet ang,’ a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Chuvângin, Israel zawng zawng, Lalpa mi pung khâwm leh kan Pathian thupêkte chu ngaihvenin fîmkhur takin awm rawh u; tichuan, he ram ṭha tak hi in nei ang a, in fate pawhin an rochung kumkhua thei dâwn nia,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Solomona hnênah chuan, “Nang, ka fapa Solomona, i pa Pathian hi pawm la, châk tak leh tihtakzetin a rawng bâwl ang che, kan ngaihtuah leh kan tumte hi a hre vek a ni. Ani chu i zawn phawt chuan i hmu ngei ang a, i ngaihsak loh erawh chuan a paihthla hlen ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />A Hmun Thianghlima in sa tûrin Lalpa chuan a thlang che tih hre rawh, ṭan la la, thawk ṭan rawh,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Davida chuan a fapa Solomona hnênah Tempul sak dân tûr ruahmanna: kudâm tûr te, pindan chi hrang hrang te, Hmun Thianghlim Ber te, sual ngaihdamna hmun rem dân tûrte chu a pe a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tual hungchhûng chei dân tûr te, a vêla in sak dân tûr te, Tempula hman bungbêl dah ṭhatna tûr te, Lalpa hnêna thilpêk dah ṭhatna sak dân tûr a lo ruahman dânte a hrilh vek a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Puithiamho leh Levia chiten an hna an thawha, Tempul chhûnga rawng an bâwl dân tûr te, Tempula bungbêl awm enkawl dân tûra a ruahman dânte a hrilh bawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Bungbêl siam nân tangkarua leh rangkachak eng zât nge hman tûr tih te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />khâwnvâr leh a dahna siamna tûr zât te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />tangkaraw dawhkân te, Pathian tâna chhang serh dahna tûr dawhkâna tangkaraw hman zât tûrte a hrilh bawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Thîrkut te, maihûnte leh uain thâwl siam nân rangkachak hlîr hlak hman zât tûr te, thlêng siam nân tangkarua leh rangkachak hman zât tûrte a hrilh vek a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Rimtui hâlna dawhkân siam nâna rangkachak hlîr hman tûr zât te, Lalpa Thuthlung Bâwm chunga Cherub thla zâr tawlailîr siam nâna rangkachak hlîr hlak hman tûr zât te pawh a hrilh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Lal Davida chuan, “ Lalpa min hrilh ang ngeia tih tûr ruahman ziaknaah chûng chu ziak vek a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Lal Davida chuan a fapa Solomona hnênah, “I tum tiruh la, ṭan la rawh, hna chu thawk ṭan rawh, tu man tikhawtlai che suh se. Ka Pathian, a rawng ka bâwl ṭhîn, Lalpa Pathian chuan a awmpui ang che, Lalpa chuan a Tempul i sak zawh hma chu a thlah lo vang che a, a hawisan hek lo vang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tempula puithiamte leh Levia chite thawh tûr ruat fel a ni tawh a. Mi themthiam, thawk châk tak tak an tam a, mite leh an hruaitute chu i thu nghâkin an awm ṭhuap a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="29" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Lal Davida chuan pungkhâwmho hnênah, “Ka fapa Solomona hi Pathian mi thlan chu a ni; mahse, a la naupang hle a, chinchâng a la hre tâwk lo. Hna thawh tûr hi a tam hle a ni, a sak tûr hi mihring in tûr a ni lo, Lalpa , Pathian in tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ka theih chin chin chu châk ka lo chhuah tawh a, rangkachak te, tangkarua te, dâr te, thîr te, thing te, lunghlu te, lungmantam te, lungmawi te leh sailungvâr te ka la khâwm tawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Hêng bâkah hian keima sum aṭangin tangkarua leh rangkachak ka pe bawk a ni. Pathian Tempul tûr hi ka vei êm avângin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ofir rangkachak ṭha chi kg. nuaikhat, rawh thianghlim tangkarua kg. nuaihnih leh sîngli dâwn lai Tempul chhûng lam bang chei nân te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />themthiamhovin an duh anga an cheimawi nânte ka pe a ni. Lalpa tân tu nge thilpêk ṭhahnem tâwk pe ve phal le?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Hnam tin hotu te, chi tin hruaitu te, sâng hotu te, za hotu te leh sawrkâr hna thawkho chuan phal takin thilpêk an pe ve ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tempul sak nân chuan rangkachak kg. nuaikhat leh sîngsarih, tangkarua kg. nuai zathum leh sawmli, dâr kg. nuai zaruk leh sawmhnih, thîr kg. nuai sângthum leh zali aia tam mah an pe a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Lungmantam neite pawhin Lalpa Tempul atân an pe a, Gersona thlah Jehielan a enkawl a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Mipui chu an hlim hle mai, phal taka mahni thu ngeia Lalpa tâna pe an nih avângin an lâwm a ni, lal Davida pawh namên lovin a lâwm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Chuvângin, Davida chuan Israel pungkhâwmho hmaah Lalpa chu a fak a, “Aw Lalpa , kan pu Israela Pathian, kumkhuaa chawimawi tlâk i ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />I ropui a, thil i ti thei a, i chungnung a, i mawi a, lei leh vâna thil zawng zawng hi i ta a ni a, Aw Pathian, i lalber a, engkim chunga thuneitu i ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Hausakna leh chawimawina zawng zawng hi i hnên aṭanga lo kal a ni a, chakna leh thiltihtheihna i kawl a, mi i siam lian a, i tichak ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Chuvângin, kan Pathian, lâwmthu kan hrilh a che, i hming ropui tak chu kan fak a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Kei leh ka mite tehlul hian hetiang khawpa tam i hnêna thilhlan kan pe thei che hi kan theih avânga pe che kan ni lo ve; engkim hi i ta a ni a, i ta chu kan rawn pe mai che a nih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Aw Pathian, i hmaah chuan kan pi leh pute ang khân keini pawh mikhual, rei lo tê châm ang lek kan ni a, kan dam chhûng nite chu hlimthla ang lek a ni a, a ral mai ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Aw Lalpa , kan Pathian, i hming chawimawi tûra i in sak nân châk kan lo chhuahte pawh hi i hnên aṭanga lo kal, i ta vek a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Mi thinlung chhûngril i fiah ṭhîn a, mi nun ngîlte chu i lâwm ṭhîn. Kei chuan hêng thilte hi phal tak leh rilru ṭha tak puin i hnênah ka rawn hlân a ni; i mi, lo pungkhâwmte pawhin thilhlan rawn pêk che an châkzia ka hmu a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Aw Pathian, min thlahtu Abrahama te, Isaka te, Jakoba te Pathian, hetiang rilru hi i mite puttîr reng la, i laka an rinawm reng theih nân vêng ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Ka fapa Solomona hi i thupêk châk taka zâwm zêl thei tûrin vêng la, i Tempul, a châkte ka lâk ṭeuh tawh chu sa puitling tûrin ṭanpui ang che,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Davida chuan mipuite chu, “In Pathian Lalpa hi fak rawh u,” a ti a. Pungkhâwmho chuan an thlahtu Pathian Lalpa chu an fak a, an kûn a, Lalpa chu an chawimawi a, lal pawh an chawimawi a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />A tûkah chuan ran an talh a, Lalpa hnênah thilhlan an hlân a, mipui pawh an eitîr a. Bâwngpa sâng, berâmchal sâng, berâmno sâng an talh a, maichâma hâlral thilhlan pawh an rawn hlân a. Uain thilhlan pawh an rawn hlân a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Chumi ni chuan Lalpa hmaah hlim takin an eiin an in ta a. Solomona chu lalah an puang nawn leh a, Lalpa hmingin rorêltuah hriak an thih a, Zadoka pawh puithiamah hriak an thih a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tichuan, Solomonan a pa lalṭhutthlêng, Lalpa dinsak chu a luah ta a, lal tling tak a ni, Israel mi zawng zawngin a thu an awih a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Sawrkâr milian, sipaite leh Davida fa dangte pawhin Solomona chu an lala pawm tûrin thu an tiam a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Solomona chu Lalpa chuan hnam pum pui a ngaihsântîr a, Israel chunga rorêltu zawng zawng aiin Solomona chu a chawimawi a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Jesaia fa Davida chu Israel zawng zawng chungah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />kum sawmli a lal a, Hebron-ah kum sarih, Jerusalem-ah kum sawmthum leh pathum.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tarkûna damin a thi ta a; a hausa êm êm a, mi zah a kai a, a fapa Solomona chu a aiah a lal ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Davida chanchin, a tîr aṭanga a tâwp thlengin zâwlnei pathum Samuela, Nathana leh Gada te lehkhabu-ah ziak vek a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />A ro rêl dân te, thil a tih theihzia te, a chunga thil thleng te, Israel leh an chhehvêl ram chunga thil thlengte an ziak vek a ni.
  </para>
</usx>
